(1, 1, 'What’s yoga teacher training India like?', 'A hands-on program, often in Rishikesh yoga, per Adhiroha’s About Page.'),
(2, 1, 'How long is a yoga instructor course India?', '200 hours, about 3–4 weeks.'),
(3, 1, 'Is the yoga certification in India legit?', 'Yes, with Yoga Alliance support.'),
(4, 1, 'Where to learn to teach yoga in India?', 'Rishikesh yoga is top, and Find your perfect yoga course.'),
(5, 1, 'What’s in a yoga training course in India?', 'Asanas, meditation, and teaching skills.'),
(6, 2, 'How much does yoga teacher training cost in Rishikesh?', 'Yoga teacher training India can cost from €1275 to €2000.'),
(7, 2, 'Is 40 too old to become a yoga teacher?', 'Nope! Rishikesh yoga schools like Adhiroha welcome all ages. 200-hour courses suit beginners, building skills for yoga course India. “Yoga’s the seed, Rishikesh is the bloom!” '),
(8, 2, 'How do I choose a yoga teacher training in Rishikesh?', 'Pick yoga instructor certification India by checking: \r\nYoga Alliance certification (e.g., Adhiroha).\r\nHatha or Ashtanga focus.'),
(14, 4, 'What are the 7 chakras and their effects?', 'They’re energy centers impacting health, emotions, and spirituality, from Root (grounding) to Crown (enlightenment), taught in Adhiroha’s yoga teacher training Rishikesh.'),
(15, 4, 'How do I spot chakra imbalances?', 'Look for anxiety (Root) or confusion (Third Eye). Adhiroha’s Rishikesh yoga programs help balance them with chakra balancing yoga.'),
(16, 4, 'Why is Rishikesh ideal for chakra balancing yoga?', 'Its Ganga and Himalayan vibes amplify energy work, with Adhiroha yoga retreat as the perfect hub for yoga India Rishikesh.'),
(17, 4, 'Can beginners try chakra balancing yoga?', 'Absolutely! Adhiroha’s yoga instructor training India and online classes offer accessible techniques for all.'),
(18, 4, 'How do I join Adhiroha’s yoga teacher training India?', 'You can join Adhiroha’s yoga teacher training in India by selecting your preferred course, filling out the online application form, and completing the registration payment. Once confirmed, you’ll receive all joining details and preparation guidelines from the Adhiroha team.'),
(19, 5, 'Can beginners do these office yoga poses?', 'Yes! These poses are beginner-friendly, requiring no prior yoga experience or flexibility. They’re designed for all skill levels.'),
(20, 5, 'How often should I practice during work?', 'Aim for every 2–3 hours or whenever you feel stiffness or stress creeping in. Even one session a day makes a difference.'),
(21, 5, 'Can I do office yoga in formal clothes?', 'Absolutely! These poses are tailored for workwear, so you can stretch comfortably in a suit or dress.'),
(22, 5, 'Do corporate wellness jobs include office yoga programs?', 'Many do! Companies, especially in wellness-focused cities like Sydney, offer guided office yoga as part of employee benefits to boost health and morale.'),
(23, 6, 'What is yoga for well-being?', 'Yoga for well-being integrates asanas, breathwork, and meditation for holistic health yoga, offered at Adhiroha yoga school’s Rishikesh yoga retreats'),
(24, 6, 'How does Rishikesh yoga help health?', 'Rishikesh yoga improves flexibility and reduces stress, supporting yoga for US health and European yoga for happiness.'),
(25, 6, 'Are Adhiroha’s programs suitable for beginners?', 'Yes, yoga certification India at Adhiroha offers beginner-friendly Rishikesh yoga.'),
(26, 6, 'Is European yoga for happiness part of Adhiroha’s offerings?', 'Yes, European yoga for happiness emphasizes mindfulness in yoga certification India.'),
(27, 7, 'What’s a sattvic diet?', 'A vegetarian, organic sattvic diet for yoga boosts energy and clarity, per Ayurveda Portal.'),
(28, 7, 'Can I eat sattvic at home?', 'Yes! Try Adhiroha’s Sattvic Recipes for holistic yoga nutrition.'),
(29, 7, 'Does Adhiroha handle dietary restrictions?', 'Absolutely, Adhiroha yoga retreats offer gluten-free, lactose-free, and vegan Ayurvedic meals for yoga.'),
(30, 7, 'How does food help yoga?', ' Rishikesh yoga nutrition improves energy and focus, per Harvard Health.'),
(31, 7, 'Is Adhiroha good for beginners?', 'Yes, Adhiroha yoga retreats welcome all levels with sattvic diet for yoga.'),
(32, 7, 'How do I join Adhiroha?', 'Sign up via Adhiroha’s Application Form for 2025 Rishikesh yoga nutrition programs.'),
(33, 8, 'What’s an ashram like?', 'A serene space for yoga and community, per Adhiroha’s About Page.'),
(34, 8, 'Are Adhiroha’s ashrams beginner-friendly?', 'Yes, Adhiroha yoga retreats welcome all levels'),
(35, 8, 'What’s the best time for Rishikesh yoga 2025?', 'October–March suits yoga ashram for US wellness, ashram for Australians, and European yoga retreat.'),
(36, 8, 'What’s included in ashram stays?', 'Sattvic meals, rooms, yoga, and outings in Rishikesh ashram retreat.'),
