(12, 'Mitzi Casadei', 'mitzi_casadei@hotmail.com', '4385303121', 'Hi! I hope you are doing good. I just booked my place for the 200 YTT in september. I had previously booked a place with you a year ago, but couldn&#39;t make it at that moment. I was wondering if the amount i had already given to you could be transfered to the totality of the final price? thank you, can&#39;t wait to see start this journey!  ', 'Website Form', '2025-07-10 20:44:09'),
