(14, 'Swati Ranade', 'swati.ranade18@gmail.com', '09821128567', 'Hello Rudra,\r\nNamaste. \r\nI am Swati and i am a working professional in Mumbai. I am interested in Yoga (mostly 500 hours) and also in Sound Therapy.  Also i would require residential and hence please share the costing.   \r\nI may not get 2 months of leave and therefore i may quit my corporate job - I am looking at a batch in March or 1st April 2026. \r\nLooking forward to hearing from your side.', 'Website Form', '2025-07-16 17:25:43'),
