(20, 'Isabelle Weinmann', 'IsabelleWeinmann@gmx.de', '017643696562', 'Dear Adhiroha-Team,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\nI am very interested in your 300-hour yoga teacher training program in Rishikesh and would love to learn more about it. Could you please provide me with a more detailed overview of the full curriculum and course contents? I couldn&#39;t find it on the website and would like to read more about it.\r\n\r\nThank you very much in advance.\r\nWarm regards,\r\nIsabelle', 'Website Form', '2025-08-04 21:12:03'),
(21, 'valeria', 'vale_mramos@hotmail.com', '', 'Hello,\r\nI am writing to you because my husband and I are planning to travel to India in December/January/February. We haven&#39;t set the dates yet, but we are interested in the 6-day Ayurvedic retreat and would like to know the price and if there are any dates available during those months. Thank you.', 'Website Form', '2025-08-09 21:44:56'),
(22, 'Inanna Fronius ', 'inanna.fronius1@gmail.com', '', 'Hello, \r\nI am interested in joining the sound healing course 1.-6.11.2025 \r\nCould you please tell me when I need to arrive, on the 31.10. as the course I guess starts on the 1.11. in the morning? \r\nAnd how many hours of tuition per day is included in the course. please? \r\nIs the 6.11. only for departure? I have to be in Vrindhavan on the 6.11. in the evening. will this be possible? \r\nAnd finally, can you please tell me the full price for tuition, meals and accommodation (twin or triple) for the time of the course?\r\nOn the website I found different prices.\r\n\r\nThank you so much for your help, \r\nInanna \r\n', 'Website Form', '2025-08-16 15:45:52'),
(23, 'Freya Kelly', 'freya.clare.kelly@gmail.com', '61410524361', 'Hey there!\r\nI&#39;m interested in doing the 200 YTT in October. \r\nWill we be on site for on the 24th (and sleep there?) or should a book a flight for that day? Or the 25th? Thanks for your help :)\r\nFreya', 'Website Form', '2025-08-18 14:27:04'),
(24, 'Freya Kelly', 'freya.clare.kelly@gmail.com', '61410524361', 'Hey guys, \r\nI was also wondering what transport options you recommend for getting from Delhi > Dehradun? I see there are flights but if you recommend a particular airline or other transport route, please let me know. \r\nKind regards,\r\nFreya Kelly', 'Website Form', '2025-08-18 15:18:54'),
(25, 'May Mcveigh', 'becca_may@mac.com', '', 'Hi i am wondering if you are a RYS (registered yoga school) as I cant find it on your website if you are or are not. I also can not find you in the Yoga Alliance Directory, (so I could register with a Globally recognised group, to be allowed to work as a yoga teacher globally) of registered schools, but that could be because maybe you are register with them with a slightly different name than ‘Adhiroha’.', 'Website Form', '2025-08-21 13:16:39'),
(26, 'Gabie', 'avogaaado14@gmail.com', '', 'Namaste!\r\nCan you please tell me if we get a certificate accredited by RYS?\r\nThank you ', 'Website Form', '2025-08-26 21:02:50'),
(27, 'Nikitha Reddy', 'blackmindsfoundations@gmail.com', '', 'Interested in being a part of the October 2025 one week veranda and meditation retreat .\r\nDouble sharing \r\nWanted further details regarding Number of people that might be per retreat session ? \r\n', 'Website Form', '2025-08-28 12:05:32'),
(28, 'Craig Byrd', 'cnbyrdgoo@gmail.com', '+01  505 416 1549', 'Namaste... My name is Craig Byrd and I live in Santa Fe, NM, USA.  I have decided to do my 300 hour YTT at your ashram.  My plan is to arrive on Wednesday, 23 September 2026 for the Ayurveda retreat and start the training on the first of October 2026.  I am watching for the registration to open for these programs now that I have made this decision.  Please notify me when these dates become available for registration.  I look forward to visiting you and continuing to grow my understanding of yoga with your training.\r\nBest Regards,\r\nCraig', 'Website Form', '2025-08-28 21:24:32'),
(29, 'Alyshia Skanse', 'alyskanse@gmail.com', '2063591399', 'Hi! I am interested in doing your yoga teacher training in February 2026. Before I sign up I have some questions. How many students are in each training course? Is the Ashram within walking distance of any places to visit?\r\n\r\nThank you!', 'Website Form', '2025-09-07 04:53:10'),
