(81, 'Lydia Ivins', 'lydiaivins5@gmail.com', '+447908909573', 'Namaste, \r\n\r\nI would love to join 2 courses, first the Hatha and Yin course,  followed by the Pranayam and meditation course.  I already have completed 200 hour and 300 hour training, but i would like to revisit some of the teachings to refresh my memory.  I&#39;m currently trained in Hatha, Ashtanga and Vinyasa.  \r\n\r\nMy questions, is there a special price for joining 2 courses?  I am looking to join in February.  next question is, during the meditation and pranayama course, does it include any asana movement practice, if not, is there any dedicated time for self practice?\r\n\r\nnext question, what is the size of the classes, what is the maximum nunmber of students on each course?\r\n\r\nThank you\r\nLydia', 'Website Form', '2025-12-27 03:08:37'),
