(86, 'Paul Labrousse', 'labrousse.paul@net-c.com', '0671860946', 'Hello\r\nI&#39;ve contacted you few weeks ago for the 200 h yoga teacher trainning.  I&#39;ve contacted différents schools to make sure  that I&#39;ll find the correct ashram for my needs.\r\nI&#39;m Paul,  I&#39;ll be 50 in march and I want want to offer me this trainning as a gift for my 50&#39;s birthday ...I&#39;d like to join in april if there&#39;s availability? \r\nHave you got single room? I&#39;m ok with sharing a room but I might snore...\r\nI&#39;m not that good at yoga, i have discovered it 10 years ago, i am a pilates teacher for elders and autistic children in France . \r\nI think that yoga is great and in want to progress (even if I&#39;m not good with inversions and breathing) \r\nI&#39;ll be pleased to heard from you.\r\nThank you\r\nPaul\r\n\r\n', 'Website Form', '2026-01-18 17:17:46'),
(87, 'Harley ', 'harleyleckenby@hotmail.com', '', 'Hello :) I&#39;m looking to come do a teacher training course on May 1st. Right now im undecided whether to take the yin yoga with hatha course or the 300 hour course (i previously completed my 200 hour in Chiang Mai, Thailand. I wanted to ask your advice on visas. Im from the uk and what i can understand is i can get a 30 day tourist E Visa. However, from reading online it seems the visa date goes from the moment the visa is confirmed-not when entering the country. So Im a little confused how id go about getting the visa successfully as the course is 28 days long.. it seems like its cutting it fine. Do you have any advice or information about this? Anything will be great! Thanks so much :) ', 'Website Form', '2026-01-20 13:24:51'),
(88, 'Zoe Fryklund ', 'zoefryklund@gmail.com', '13063131770', 'Hello! My name is Zoe. I am from Vancouver Canada. I am very interested in your 100 hour ashtanga and vinyasa YTT April 1-14. I would be interested in airport pick up. When should I register to reserve a spot in the course? \r\n\r\n', 'Website Form', '2026-01-22 20:41:10'),
(89, 'Giulia', 'giuliagamberini84@gmail.com', '', 'Dear Adhiroha School,\r\nMy name is Giulia, and I am currently training to become a Death Doula / Holistic Support Practitioner. I am very interested in your 14-day Pranayama & Meditation TTC in Rishikesh, as I am seeking practical techniques that I can integrate into my future professional practice.\r\nMy goal is to learn methods to guide others safely and confidently through breathwork and meditation, providing tools that help people find calm, emotional balance, and inner awareness.\r\nCould you please confirm whether the course provides practical skills and structured methodologies suitable for someone aiming to support clients professionally in this way?\r\nI would greatly appreciate any additional information about how the course prepares students to apply the techniques in real-life sessions.\r\nThank you very much for your time and guidance. I look forward to your reply.\r\nBest regards,\r\nGiulia Gamberini', 'Website Form', '2026-01-23 11:40:42'),
(90, 'Vikas Pasari', 'vikaspasari@hotmail.com', '9830038129', 'Namaste\r\n\r\nI am a recently retired 58 year old male, Indian national, living in Kolkata. \r\nI would like to find out more about your residential beginner yoga courses.v\r\nI am unable to reach the phone numbers given on your website. \r\nPlease call me at 98300 38139\r\nRegards\r\nVikas Pasari\r\n\r\n', 'Website Form', '2026-01-24 16:57:35'),
