(93, 'Nick', 'hello@aeroleads.com', 'Nick', 'Hi Adhiroha   Experience Yoga team,\r\n\r\nI&#39;m the developer of AeroLeads (https://aeroleads.com). I have built a free Chrome plugin that helps you find emails and phone numbers directly from LinkedIn.\r\n\r\nYou can also download contacts, do company research, and manage your outreach easily. Companies like Data for India, OneLab, and Infruid Labs are already using it to find leads and customers. Many of them have seen sales growth of over 150% after using our plugin and tool.\r\n\r\nDownload the plugin here - https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/aeroleadscom-free-b2b-pho/fcpepipgmkkjnljechjjimkaondedmbe\r\n\r\nI am also adding a free CRM and autodialer soon. I&#39;d love your feedback or feature suggestions. If you&#39;d like free credits to test the software or find more leads, just message me.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nNick\r\n', 'Website Form', '2026-01-31 12:31:51'),
