(95, 'Sanjay Valji Kerai', 'sanjaykerai99@yahoo.co.uk', '07917386003', 'Dear Adhiroha team\r\n\r\nOn your website I see rates published in Euros. Could you please advise if there is a local rate for Indian citizens ? I am interested in the &#34;Yoga & Ayurveda Retreat in Rishikesh&#34;. \r\n\r\nAlso I notice (perhaps in correctly) the gallery has mainly females i nthe pictures. Please confirm males are permitted to attend. apologies if the question is strange but better to ask a stupid question then release later it wasn&#39;t.\r\n\r\nthanks in advance\r\nSanjay', 'Website Form', '2026-02-03 20:04:20'),
