(97, 'María Chomnalez', 'mayathym@pt.lu', '691470204', 'Dear Adhiroha team,\r\nI am interested in your Yin ( principal) and Hatha teacher training. I have done last year the 200 h multiple yoga in Goa ( at Kashish ).\r\nI would like to know if there is a possibility to have a private room, only for me and probably with my husband. \r\nCould you please send me the dates and prices for that?\r\nHave a great day!\r\nKind regards,\r\nMaría Thym', 'Website Form', '2026-02-16 14:16:33'),
(98, 'Mousumi Ghosh', 'ghosh81mg@gmail.com', '', 'This blog is very informative and full of healed feeling. My son is showing all negative traits of disbalance of all most all chakras. He wants to move away from India forever on a huge loan amount (which is not feasible for his parents) by hook or crook, on the name of higher undergraduate study that too as a direct admission for 5 years(approx. Rs100 crore budget). He isnot speaking properly to his parents, often say bulshits, try to beat his mother, taking either one time or two time meal. no yoga , pranayam , friends , social circle or god reading, sport OR ANY SORT OF CONVERSATION. He has a delayed developed sibling of 10 years old. I have tried to learn crystal therapy , shamanic practices, chakra cleansing, access consciousness .....but he (my son) is not allowing for any therapy. It sems life is shrinking day by day and I could not do any sort of shifting....PLAESE HELP/GUIDE ME HOW CAN I HELP MY SON , MY HUSBAND (BOTH DO NOT BELIEVE IN GOD MAY BE DUE TO HARSHIPS IN LIFE SEEN TIL NOW) TO COME OUT OF THE SITUATION INCLUDING ME?', 'Website Form', '2026-02-23 16:18:37'),
(99, 'Karan Rohilla', 'Karanrohilla16@gmail.com', '9896344366', '200hr yoga + more courses ', 'Website Form', '2026-02-24 12:56:37'),
(100, 'Ornella', 'odellafiori@gmail.com', '+1 4085688475', 'Hi, im very interest to start a 200 hours program with you in April, I was just wondering if there is any options to link my course with Ayurveda massages or treatments', 'Website Form', '2026-02-25 07:17:23'),
(101, 'Ilina Davies', 'ilina.davies@guestpostshark.com', '07426449886', '&#34;Hello,\r\n\r\nI came across this article: https://www.healthcaregroups.in/2026/02/preventive-healthcare-in-2026-early.html that links to your website adhiroha.com.\r\n\r\nIf you’d like to get more guest posts like this to strengthen your site’s visibility, we can help. We work with relevant, high-quality blogs and handle the entire process for you.\r\n\r\nWould you like me to share a few examples and pricing details? You can also place an order directly at: guestpostshark.com.\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nIlina Davies\r\nWeb Site: https://guestpostshark.com/\r\n\r\nP.S. If you’d prefer not to receive these emails, just reply NO.&#34;\r\n', 'Website Form', '2026-02-26 09:50:27'),
(102, 'Payal Aghicha', 'payalkeswani584@gmail.com', '9765105585', 'please send details for 300hrs ttc ', 'Website Form', '2026-02-26 19:55:54'),
(103, 'Himanshi Wadhwani', 'wadhwanihimanshi03@gmail.com', '7999390104', 'Hi, I want to join 200 Hrs Yoga TTC, what is the process?', 'Website Form', '2026-03-05 18:28:58'),
(104, 'Tanu', 'tanu3825x@gmail.com', '', 'Hello,\r\nI&#39;m looking to do a 200-hour yoga teacher training and came across your school. I&#39;m an Indian national, so was wondering if you guys offer any scholarships or special discounts for Indian nationals? \r\nAlso, do your certificates get recognized by the Indian Yoga Association?\r\nWould really appreciate if you could let me know!\r\n\r\nThanks,', 'Website Form', '2026-03-06 18:54:55'),
(105, 'Sonika Kataria', 'sonikakataria2018@gmail.com', '+12145008732', 'Aum Namah Shivaya!\r\nNamaste Adhiroha Team.\r\n I am Sonika kataria and was as student for Sound Healing TTC  01Dec-06Dec2025. Requesting for a copy of the receipts for payment made towards the course fee (INR 95000/-) and towards the Bowl set( INR 55000/-). \r\nI need a copy of the receipts for filing taxes and request your assistance in this regards at your earliest. \r\nThank you!\r\nSonika Kataria', 'Website Form', '2026-03-07 22:21:33'),
(106, 'Anush Krsna Rao', 'etoilesduprintemps@gmail.com', '', 'Get I get more information on Pranayama and meditation teacher’s training course. ', 'Website Form', '2026-03-18 19:58:06'),
(107, 'Rosa Llorens', 'associationalcione@hotmail.com', '', 'With sincere respect,\r\n\r\nRespected Sir or Madam,\r\n\r\n\r\nMy name is Rosa Llorens, and I am writing to you on behalf of the Alcione Association of Spain. I respectfully address you in order to place at your kind disposal an important book written by a Western spiritual teacher as the result of his conscious investigations.\r\n\r\nGiven the depth, seriousness, and ancestral wisdom preserved within India’s spiritual traditions in relation to self-knowledge and liberation, and in view of the times through which civilisation is currently passing, I considered it appropriate to humbly offer this work for your consideration.\r\n\r\nThe book reflects on the future of humanity and the planet, not from a material or political perspective, but from an ethical and spiritual point of view, emphasising the elimination of the ego as the primary requirement for an authentic spiritual awakening.\r\n\r\nShould you find it of interest, you may download it directly from the Alcione Association website: https://alcioneassociation.com/spirit-en/.\r\n\r\nI sincerely thank you for your time and for your dedication to the preservation of spiritual knowledge.\r\n\r\nWith respectful regards,\r\n\r\nMrs Rosa Llorens\r\nAlcione Association\r\nSpain\r\nEmail: associationalcione@hotmail.com\r\nWebsite: https://alcioneassociation.com/alcyone-en/\r\n\r\n', 'Website Form', '2026-03-19 00:15:23'),
(108, 'Eva Singh', 'evinkasingh@gmail.com', '9004488800', 'Namaste, \r\nI would like to join your 200h Yoga TTC training 1st of April. \r\n\r\nKindly let me know if you have availability on this start date.\r\n\r\nThank you \r\nEva Singh \r\n', 'Website Form', '2026-03-19 11:31:58'),
(109, 'Madison Calle', 'madison@guestpostmate.com', '7426449886', 'Hello,\r\n\r\nI came across your article on https://www.healthcaregroups.in/2026/02/preventive-healthcare-in-2026-early.html and was wondering if you&#39;re still arranging article placements for adhiroha.com.\r\n\r\nI’m Madison Calley and I help coordinate placements on blogs that publish contributed articles with backlinks.\r\nI can share a few recent examples if helpful.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you&#39;d like to see them.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nMadison Calley\r\n', 'Website Form', '2026-03-23 10:38:15'),
(110, 'Nadia ', 'nadia.bg7@gmail.com', '', 'Good morning,\r\n\r\nMy name is Nadia Benyahya. I’m a journalist and tv reporter with 14 years experience.\r\n\r\nI discovered your space and felt a strong resonance with the atmosphere and philosophy you cultivate. I would love to attend to your YYT 200h in May and I would love to explore the possibility of some collaboration. \r\n\r\nI create short-form narrative content for cultural spaces and communities: interviews, visual storytelling and documentary-style pieces that capture the essence of a place and the experience of the people who gather there. (My content packages for retreats and cultural projects usually range between €600–€1200, depending on the scope)\r\n\r\nI would love to create content for your center in exchange for taking part in the training experience. I’ve attached via email a short overview of my storytelling work so you can get a sense of my approach. If this feels aligned with your space, I would be happy to share more details.\r\n\r\nWarmly,\r\nNadia Benyahya', 'Website Form', '2026-03-23 13:35:48'),
(111, 'Marlee Allen', 'marleeallen6@gmail.com', '5198078896', 'Hello! I&#39;m super interested in the Pranayam and Meditation course starting May 15th, how many people are registered? and do we continue through the weekend as well?\r\n\r\nLet me know :) ', 'Website Form', '2026-03-24 04:39:23'),
(112, 'Cengiz Özer', 'tchinghiz@mac.com', '+33766533411', 'Hi,\r\nI’m interested by your 200 Hour Yoga Teacher Training program and intend to do it this summer in july with a triple sharing fee. Can you give me more info about what’s needed and how much it cost in totals to help me making my choice. \r\nThank you very much.\r\nBest regards,\r\nCengiz', 'Website Form', '2026-04-03 15:51:27'),
(113, 'laim', 'laimseoagency@gmail.com', '9876543212', 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nHope you’re doing well. \r\n\r\nWe’re offering a great opportunity to feature your brand through guest posts, sponsored content, and collaborations on our high-authority, Google News–approved websites with strong organic traffic.  \r\n\r\nBelow is an overview of some of our featured platforms and their latest metrics:\r\n\r\nhttps://bnonews.com/\r\n DA: 67 PA: 60 DR: 72 Traffic: 92.4K\r\n\r\nhttps://impactwealth.org/\r\n DA: 58 PA: 52 DR: 64 Traffic: 45.1K\r\n\r\nhttps://goodmenproject.com/\r\n DA: 80 PA: 68 DR: 77 Traffic: 1.9M\r\n\r\nhttps://www.lexinter.net/\r\n DA: 60 PA: 54 DR: 68 Traffic: 76.3K\r\n\r\nhttps://researchsnipers.com/\r\n DA: 56 PA: 50 DR: 63 Traffic: 120.8K\r\n\r\nhttps://humansofglobe.com/a\r\n DA: 54 PA: 48 DR: 61 Traffic: 49.2K\r\n\r\nhttps://ecommercefastlane.com/\r\n DA: 65 PA: 56 DR: 72 Traffic: 111.4K\r\n\r\nhttps://www.indiehackers.com/\r\n DA: 75 PA: 66 DR: 80 Traffic: 1.2M\r\n\r\nhttps://www.bbntimes.com/\r\n DA: 73 PA: 60 DR: 78 Traffic: 340.5K\r\n\r\nhttps://onpattison.com/\r\n DA: 59 PA: 52 DR: 65 Traffic: 52.7K\r\n\r\nhttps://thetradable.com/\r\n DA: 68 PA: 55 DR: 71 Traffic: 174.9K\r\n\r\nhttps://www.thecuriouslycreative.com/\r\n DA: 57 PA: 49 DR: 62 Traffic: 61.2K\r\n\r\nIf this aligns with your marketing goals, we’d love to discuss packages or provide tailored site recommendations for your niche.\r\n\r\nseasile regards\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'Website Form', '2026-04-04 23:47:23'),
(114, 'Prasanthi B', 'prasanthiravikanth@gmail.com', '7989973734', 'Hi \r\nI am interested in Yoga Teacher Training. \r\nhave couple of questions \r\n1. With no prior yoga practice, can I take the course?\r\n2. I see the training cost is not in rupees, - could you inform?\r\n3. Apart from Rishikesh, is there any other branch in south India to join?', 'Website Form', '2026-04-06 18:52:50'),
(115, 'Nina Kollmann', 'ninakollmann1@gmail.com', '+436781241257', 'Hello Adhiroha Yoga School Team,\nI hope you are doing well.\nMy name is Nina Kollmann, and I am very interested in joining your 200-hour Yoga Teacher Training in Rishikesh starting on August 1st, 2026.\nI have a few questions before completing my booking:\n•	Are there still available spots for the August 1st, 2026 course?\n•	What room options are currently available (private room or shared room)?\n•	I would prefer a quieter room if possible – could you please let me know what you recommend?\n•	Is airport pickup from Dehradun included or can it be arranged?\n•	Could you please confirm the total price including accommodation and all fees?\nI am particularly interested in breathwork (pranayama), meditation, and personal development, and I would like to complete a certified training that could also support me in sharing this work in the future.\nI will be traveling alone from Austria and am very much looking forward to this experience.\nThank you very much in advance for your help. I am really looking forward to your reply.\nWarm regards,\nNina ', 'Website Form', '2026-04-06 20:19:38'),
(116, 'Nikky Kho', 'nikky@nikkykho.com', '6176201175', 'Is it possible to do a one night stay where I arrive in the evening of April 28 and stay until the evening of April 29? I&#39;d like to get a feel of the place for Ashtanga advanced trainings. Thank you.', 'Website Form', '2026-04-21 11:06:26'),
(117, 'Hannah', 'hm@melottogroup.com', '2158218810', 'Hey! Do you have any use for a freelance writer? I have nearly a decade of experience, and I&#39;m looking for new opportunities. You can book a time with me to chat if interested. Hoping to connect! https://calendly.com/melottogroup/30min', 'Website Form', '2026-04-22 12:55:00'),
(118, 'Hannah', 'hm@melottogroup.com', '', '', 'Website Form', '2026-04-22 12:55:22'),
(119, 'Sophie', 'sophie@sendproud.com', '2155394452', 'Hi, I’m Sophie! I tried to find you on LinkedIn but couldn’t, so I’m reaching out here. I help businesses book meetings, drive traffic, and generate user sign ups through targeted outreach using my extensive private network, built over 12+ years, with access to over 100 million contacts. We’ll have a quick call to set a clear goal for your business, and I’ll personally work to make sure we reach it. You choose the result you want, whether that’s booked meetings, website traffic, user sign ups, or another measurable outcome, and if I fall short by even one, I’ll refund your money in full. Schedule a time with me here: https://calendly.com/sendproud/30min', 'Website Form', '2026-04-24 06:35:10'),
(120, 'Sophie', 'sophie@sendproud.com', '', '', 'Website Form', '2026-04-24 06:36:08'),
(123, 'Gloria', 'leonegloria@gmail.com', '', 'Hello! I&#39;m interested in your 200h yoga TTC, for teh batch of July. I have a couple of questions. How many students attend each batch?\nIs AC available? ', 'Website Form', '2026-05-12 15:16:58'),
(124, 'Isabella Kira Mani', 'bellamani@hotmail.dk', '+4550462612', 'Dear Adhiroha\n\nMe and my boyfriend are arriving at New Delhi in the end of July, and we would love to go on a yoga course & retreat at Adhiroha for about 6-7 days.\n\nWe will be in Rishikesh the 31th of July or 1st of August, depending on when we can start the retreat. I can&#39;t find any retreats for 6-7 days starting from the 1st of August on your website, which is why I&#39;m writing to you to ensure, if it is/isn&#39;t a possibility?\n\nI&#39;m looking forward to hearing from you. \n\nBest Regards,\nIsabella', 'Website Form', '2026-05-12 16:52:26'),
(126, 'test', 'test@mail.com', '', 'test', 'Website Form', '2026-05-12 18:48:14'),
(127, 'Trever', 'trever.gray@sendproud.com', '2155394452', 'Hi, I’m Trever Gray, the founder of Send Proud. We help businesses achieve measurable results like booked meetings, website traffic, and user sign-ups through highly targeted outreach powered by our database of 500M+ professional profiles and 250M+ company profiles. On our call, we’ll walk you through a clear strategy tailored specifically to your goals, whether that’s booked meetings, traffic, user sign-ups, or another measurable outcome that matters to your business. You choose the result, and we build the system to deliver it. We’re confident in our ability to execute, and if we fall short by even one agreed result, we’ll refund you in full. You can schedule a time here: https://calendly.com/sendproud/30min', 'Website Form', '2026-05-25 02:26:43'),
(128, 'Robin R Brown', 'brown.wheelihan2017@gmail.com', '4068805384', 'Hello!  Can you tell me what it means when the energies go from crown to root and when it feels like there are actual objects moving in the body?  \r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\nRobin ', 'Website Form', '2026-06-05 02:52:03');
