(129, 'Daniel Smith', 'daniel@upliftranking.com', '2494494100', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI was reading this article earlier: https://ventmagazines.co.uk/5-morning-yoga-habits-that-change/\r\n\r\nI noticed it includes a mention of your website adhiroha.com.\r\n\r\nIt made me curious whether you handle these placements internally or work with an agency for them.\r\n\r\nOur team works with a number of editorial blogs across different niches and we sometimes assist brands publish contextual articles on relevant sites.\r\n\r\nIf this is something you are currently exploring, I can share a few recent examples and how the process usually works.\r\nLet me know if that would be useful.\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nDaniel Smith\r\n', 'Website Form', '2026-06-06 15:58:55'),
(130, 'gemma crawford', 'g.crawford156@gmail.com', '07851962429 ', 'Hello, I would like to chat about my allergys to gluten onion and lavender and if this would be catered for, also having conditions that can flare up at times!  Many thanks ', 'Website Form', '2026-06-07 04:26:11'),
