(136, 'Graham Cann', 'canng56@hotmail.com', '+44 7729494530', 'Hi I am interested in studying both your Sound healing therapy course along with your Pranayama and Meditation Teaching course and would hope to enrol for Late September or early October. \r\nIs it possible to study both disciplines one after the other or do the dates clash.\r\nIm just trying to work out the logistics for my visit.\r\n\r\nThank you\r\nGraham', 'Website Form', '2026-06-16 15:02:33'),
