(141, 'Mila Nyvelt ', 'mila-nyvelt@gmx.at', '', 'Hello, I am thinking about going the 200 hours course in August and just wanted to ask if it matters in any way that I am only 18 and if the majority of other participants would be way older than me. Also I wanted to ask if the meals are vegetarian. Thank you and have a nice day, Mila ', 'Website Form', '2026-06-22 03:50:50'),
