(148, 'Ann-Sophie Gah', 'annnsophiegah@web.de', '', 'Hello Adhiroha, \r\n\r\nI&#39;d like to do the Pranayama & Meditation TTC in August or September if you have any dates available. \r\nHowever, I&#39;m traveling with my cat. Is it possible that she can stay in my room at the property? \r\nIf not then I can&#39;t do the course unfortunately. \r\n\r\nBest wishes, \r\nAnn', 'Website Form', '2026-07-02 21:51:15'),
