(291, '14684', '<MATPR06MB10677D49733CECD7C604348FF829AA@MATPR06MB10677.eurprd06.prod.outlook.com>', 'tine_year92@hotmail.com', '2026-02-02 12:14:19', 'Re: Root of Yoga | 200 Hour Yoga TTC | Rishikesh - Adhiroha', '<html class=\"apple-mail-supports-explicit-dark-mode\">\r\n<head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n</head>\r\n<body dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Adhiroha</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">I didn’t sign up for the course - at least I didn’t mean to sign up, as I am not going to Rishikesh but to Nepal.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Kind regards Martine&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\">Den 2. feb. 2026 kl. 07.30 skrev Adhiroha Yoga Centre &lt;info@adhiroha.com&gt;:<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">﻿\r\n<p>Aum Namaha Shivaya!</p>\r\n<p>Dear Martine,</p>\r\n<p>Greetings from Adhiroha. We hope you are doing well. </p>\r\n<p>With the next 200 Hour Yoga TTC in Rishikesh. approaching, we wanted to ensure you have all the information you need for a smooth and timely enrolment experience.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nShould you have any remaining questions or require guidance with your application, please feel free to connect with us. We are here to support you in every way we can.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nLooking forward to welcoming you to Adhiroha and beginning this transformative journey together!\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Warm Regards,<br>\r\nRudra (Course Counsellor)<br>\r\nThe Adhiroha Team</p>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://adhiroha.com\">Website</a> | <a href=\"https://instagram.com/adhiroha.yoga.centre\">\r\nInstagram</a> | <a href=\"https://facebook.com/adhirohayogacentre\">Facebook</a> | <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@Adhiroha\">\r\nYouTube</a> | <a href=\"https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=919999048900\">WhatsApp</a>\r\n</div>\