\">Duration: 30 Days</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Start Date: 1st June 2026</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">End Date: 29th June 2026</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Arrival: 31st May (the day before the course begins)</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Accommodation: Euros 1500 for triple sharing or Euros 2000 for double sharing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Please feel free to explore the 300 Hour Yoga TTC in Rishikesh details on our website or contact me directly with any questions. I am happy to help you understand the program, from what to expect at our Rishikesh ashram to the daily schedule.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I look forward to connecting with you and welcoming you to Adhiroha!</p>\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0px;border-width:1px medium medium;border-style:solid none none;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;border-color:rgb(204,204,204) currentcolor currentcolor\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:30px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Warm Regards,<br>Rudra (Course Counsellor)<br>The Adhiroha Team</p>\r\n<img style=\"width: 90%; max-width: 90%; height: auto; display: block; margin-top: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\" src=\"https://adhiroha.com/info/signature-mail2.jpg\" alt=\"Adhiroha Email Signature\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://click.adhiroha.com/ocimage/2518b.35bb32cc3389f063/mk894add00-050b-11f1-9250-ae9c7e0b6a9f_hk2b803012d34059e21b9b4b524c634ba03925fdac3763397fec9f3b928fb93981.gif\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\"></div>\r\n</blockquote></div></div>\r\n', 0, 'incoming', 'replied', ''),
