(362, '14804', '<CANKXp0qBBD5OgT2ShCXxqSVy3hHeq6dh_aEo9xyWPb-6-0vG+g@mail.gmail.com>', '2yinfotech.info@gmail.com', '2026-02-21 08:38:19', 'Re: sammy, thanks for your interest in our 200 Hour Yoga TTC in Rishikesh', '<div dir=\"ltr\">test crm</div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Sat, Feb 21, 2026 at 2:07 PM Adhiroha &lt;<a href=\"mailto:info.adhiroha.com@viafreezohocrm.in\">info.adhiroha.com@viafreezohocrm.in</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div><div style=\"word-break:break-word;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><div style=\"word-break:break-word\">\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"word-break:break-word;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  <table id=\"m_-2457857262833702832u_body\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;border-spacing:0px;vertical-align:top;min-width:320px;margin:0px auto;background-color:rgb(231,231,231);width:100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n    <tbody>\r\n      <tr style=\"vertical-align:top\">\r\n        <td style=\"word-break:break-word;vertical-align:top;border-collapse:collapse\">\r\n          \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n          <div style=\"padding:0px;background-color:transparent\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin:0px auto;min-width:320px;max-width:500px;word-break:break-word;background-color:transparent\">\r\n              <div style=\"border-collapse:collapse;display:table;width:100%;height:100%;background-color:transparent\">\r\n                \r\n\r\n                \r\n                <div style=\"max-width:320px;min-width:500px;display:table-cell;vertical-align:top\">\r\n                  <div style=\"height:100%;width:100%\">\r\n                    \r\n                    <