INSERT INTO `mailbox_status` (`m_id`, `email_number`, `message_id`, `email_id`, `reply_date`, `m_subject`, `m_body`, `opened`, `mail_type`, `mail_status`, `unique_id`) VALUES
(363, '14829', '<6175C750-E438-49FC-8D1C-D4BC76DDF6E4@mac.com>', 'garethlangdon@mac.com', '2026-02-23 09:56:55', 'Re: Gareth, Your Inquiry About The 200 Hour YTTC', '<html><head><meta http-equiv=\"content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"></head><body style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; line-break: after-white-space;\">Hi Rudra<div><br></div><div>Thank you for reaching out to me.</div><div><br></div><div>At the moment I am looking into the possibility of undertaking my YTT 200. &nbsp;There are two possibilities, the first is that I come with my daughter in September 2026. &nbsp;If this is not possible I will likely come on my own in November 2026. &nbsp;In both scenarios we would likely get double sharing rather than triple.</div><div><br></div><div>Please advise, if I come with my daughter would I be double sharing with her or are the sharing options single sex only. &nbsp;Also, please advise the cost of the course if two of us were to come (i.e. is there a discount for more than one person).</div><div><br></div><div>Please can you explain a bit more about what certification I will get - the Yoga Alliance certification is essential but your website says this comes from an affiliate school. &nbsp;Please let me know what school this is and how this might impact me if I decide to teach going forward.</div><div><br></div><div>I cannot eat nuts - please advise if this will be an issue re. the food option. &nbsp;I am not severely allergic but should avoid them.</div><div><br></div><div>I look forward to hearing from you</div><div><br></div><div>Gareth</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br id=\"lineBreakAtBeginningOfMessage\"><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>On 23 Feb 2026, at 06:53, Adhiroha &lt;info@adhiroha.com&gt; wrote:</div><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"><div><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><div style=\"line-height: inherit; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps