 style=\"line-height: inherit; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word; border-collapse: collapse !important;\"><a href=\"https://mailer3.zohoinsights-crm.in/ck1/2518b.df84765b4/4a16c610-1084-11f1-9356-ae9c7e0b6a9f/7d09ec1cd4d613ad518291f6edf88776e56586f5/2?e=%2Fv5xrTioCqSZ0gGB34rZSydKC2oyXasjzWHMGq3IAnwyFzxZ%2FXDkU3a7DmIQbg8dbKQaAZAd87lpH5ylJz4Gpw%3D%3D\" title=\"YouTube\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"line-height: inherit; color: rgb(0, 0, 238); text-decoration: underline;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.tools.unlayer.com/social/icons/circle/youtube.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" title=\"YouTube\" width=\"32\" style=\"line-height: inherit; outline: currentcolor; text-decoration: none; clear: both; border: medium; height: auto; float: none; display: block !important; max-width: 32px !important;\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"line-height: inherit; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse; display: inline-block; table-layout: fixed; border-spacing: 0px; margin-right: 0px; width: 32px !important; height: 32px !important;\"><tbody style=\"line-height: inherit;\"><tr style=\"line-height: inherit; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse;\"><td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"line-height: inherit; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word; border-collapse: collapse !important;\"><a href=\"https://mailer3.zohoinsights-crm.in/ck1/2518b.df84765b4/4a16c610-1084-11f1-9356-ae9c7e0b6a9f/91524851171d4cd657fceb768fe7af9c18b7eff6/2?e=odz0AtrKDzoXppa3seL7ZAdFJx4Y52OmpcS3MUpPLxCZYbyqe7uOPLlSKAPoqhdj\" title=\"Facebook\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"line-height: inherit; color: rgb(0, 0, 238); text-decoration: underline;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.tools.unlayer.com/social/icons/circle/facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook\" title=\"Facebook\" width=\"32\" style=\"line-height: inherit; outline: currentcolor; text-decoration: none; clear: both; border: medium; height: auto; float: none; display: block !important; max-width: 32px !important;\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><img src=\"https://mailer3.zohoinsights-crm.in/ocimage/2518b.df84765b4/mk4a16c610-1084-11f1-9356-ae9c7e0b6a9f_hk757b7772c030b2456d6fdc03b83e3271eafba7e6ed740d2eece26320c0136b82.gif\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\" style=\"line-height: inherit; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div></blockquote></div><br></div></body></html>', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', '');
INSERT INTO `mailbox_status` (`m_id`, `email_number`, `message_id`, `email_id`, `reply_date`, `m_subject`, `m_body`, `opened`, `mail_type`, `mail_status`, `unique_id`) VALUES
(364, '14830', '<PA3P192MB294732E838D2825705972DC9C977A@PA3P192MB2947.EURP192.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM>', 'mariagrigore@outlook.com', '2026-02-23 10:28:59', 'Re: Maria, Your Inquiry About The 200 Hour YTTC', '<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n<style type=\"text/css\" style=\"display:none;\"> P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\nHi Rudra,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\nThank you for this.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\nI have already sent a query asking what is the maximum number of students you allow per cohort?&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\nI have read some reviews about the course accepting too many students and teachers not being able to correct alignment, just because there are too many people in the class.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\nI have also read reviews about strict \'punishment\' and I would like to understand what exactly does this mean - will the punishment affect attendance to classes? I understand there is a code of conduct and that is absolutely acceptable (I do not plan on disrespecting\r\n this) - but if a \'punishment\' means losing classes, then this would be an issue for me.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\nI also want to know more about \'management\' as this has often come out in negative reviews - is there any change in the way that management treats the students?&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\nThank you much! Otherwise, your ashram looks paradisial and most reviews speak very well of your classes and food 🙂 I am very interested in coming here, and I have a friend who would be joining me as well. We just want to make sure that this experience is\r\n in line with the yogic philosophy, and that we will be able to learn as much as possible, especially in terms of correct posture and meditation.</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\nBest wishes,</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" class=\"elementToProof\">\r\nMaria</div>\r\n<hr style=\"display: inline-block; width: 98%;\">\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px;\" id=\"divRplyFwdMsg\">\r\n<div style=\"direction: ltr; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<b>From:</b>&nbsp;Adhiroha &lt;info@adhiroha.com&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b>&nbsp;23 February 2026 9:30<br>\r\n<b>To:</b>&nbsp;mariagrigore@outlook.com &lt;mariagrigore@outlook.com&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b>&nbsp;Maria, Your Inquiry About The 200 Hour YTTC</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction: ltr; margin: 0px;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<table style=\"background-color: rgb(231, 231, 231); margin: 0px auto; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; table-layout: fixed; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"x_u_body\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px auto; max-width: 500px; min-width: 320px;\">\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px; max-width: 320px; min-width: 500px; display: table-cell;\">\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" align=\"left\">\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><img style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 500px; display: inline-block; float: none;\" src=\"https://assets.unlayer.com/projects/245254/1723384152468-1.jpg\"></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px auto; max-width: 500px; min-width: 320px;\">\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px; max-width: 320px; min-width: 500px; display: table-cell;\">\r\n<div style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; border-radius: 0px;\">\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 18px 16px 21px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" align=\"left\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 140%; margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(224, 62, 45); line-height: 22.4px;\"><b>Aum Namaha Shivaya!</b></span><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 140%; margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Dear Maria,<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 140%; margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Thank you for reaching out and showing interest in our 200 Hour Yoga Teacher Training Course in Rishikesh.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 140%; margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">I am Rudra your course counsellor and i will guide you through out the process.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPlease let us know if you’d like details about course dates, syllabus, accommodation, fees, or anything else you’re curious about.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px auto; max-width: 500px; min-width: 320px;\">\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px; max-width: 320px; min-width: 500px; display: table-cell;\">\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse