n April 2026. Here are the details to help you prepare:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"font-size:15px;padding-left:20px\"><li>Duration: 24 Days</li><li>Start Date: 1st  April 2026</li><li>End Date: 24th April 2026</li><li>Arrival: 1 Day Before Course Starts</li><li>Accommodation: Euros 1275 for Triple Sharing or Euros 1650 for Double Sharing</li></ul>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">Please feel free to explore the 200 Hour Yoga TTC in Rishikesh details on our website or contact me directly with any questions. I am happy to help you understand the program, from what to expect at our Rishikesh ashram to the daily schedule.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">I look forward to connecting with you and welcoming you to Adhiroha!</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Warm Regards,</span><br /><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Rudra (Course Counsellor)</span><br /><span style=\"color:rgb( 0 , 0 , 0 );font-family:&#39;arial&#39; , &#39;helvetica&#39; , sans-serif;background-color:rgb( 255 , 255 , 255 )\"><font size=\"3\">WhatsApp: &#43;91-9999-048-900</font></span><br /><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The Adhiroha Team</span></p></div>\r\n</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><img src=\"https://mailer3.zohoinsights-crm.in/ocimage/2518b.df84765b4/mk56adde00-163c-11f1-9369-d2cf08f4ca8c_hk7ed7bfa3277427d1c34f61c8fc346fba90bcd305758df927ec9033f9a18eb795.gif\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\" /></div></blockquote></div><br></div>', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', ''),
(376, '14920', '<CAKA2oN_J0sqnQcyyPz+bhhotscj_oZxFvZ2hLzPid9T60H_K-A@mail.gmail.com>', 'jkillgour@gmail.com', '2026-03-02 21:35:40', 'Re: Booking 300 hour', '<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Rudra, <div><br></div><div>My self and my sister Nerida Lewis have already registered through the app, in which we were sent via your whatsapp number. </div><div><br></div><div>Please confirm you have received our registration as we will be booking our flights on Friday. </div><div><br></div><div>Warm regards,</div><div><br></div><div><div>Jacqueline Killgour</div><div>0438878802</div><div><a href=\"mailto:jkillgour@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">jkillgour@gmail.com</a></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Tue, Mar 3, 2026 at 3:48 AM Adhiroha Yoga Ashram &lt;<a href=\"mailto:info@adhiroha.com\">info@adhiroha.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"auto\">Aum Namaha Shivaya!</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Dear Jacky, </div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Greetings from Adhiroha. Hope you both are doing well.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">The 300 Hrs course is of 30 days scheduled from 1st to 29th of September. The arrival date is 31st of August.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Below is the Admission link to register for the course. You both need to initiate the registration separately. Post that your admission will be confirmed and see it will be secured.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\"><div style=\"font-size:inherit\" dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://www.adhiroha.com/student-admission-panel/\" style=\"font-size:inherit\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.adhiroha.com/student-admission-panel/</a></div></div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Feel free if you have any questions. You can also directly connect us on WhatsApp for faster communication. +91– 9999–048–900.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Have a peaceful day.<br clear=\"all\"><br clear=\"all\"><div dir=\"auto\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Best Wishes,</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Rudra (Course Counsellor)</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">The Adhiroha Team</div></div></div></div></div><div><br></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, 2 Mar 2026 at 08:43, Jacky Killguor &lt;<a href=\"mailto:jkillgour@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">jkillgour@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Heloo dear person, <div><br></div><div>I was just ringing you to discuss trying to book into the 300 hour yoga teacher training  for September 2026 </div><div><br></div><div>Name: Jacqueline (jacky) Killgour</div><div>&amp; </div><div>Name: Nerida Ann Lewis</div><div><br></div><div>We both  live in New South Wales Australia</div><div><br></div><div>My phone number is +61438878802</div><div><br></div><div>I look forward to revieing the booking link through WjatsApp</div><div><br></div><div>Warm Regards, </div><div><br></div><div>Jacky Killougr</div><div>0438878802</div><div><a href=\"mailto:jkillgour@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">jkillgour@gmail.com</a></div></div>\r\n</blockquote></div></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', ''),
(377, '14925', '<CALsO+jucYj4QhKhZL+V0KrF02sO-jNTDReKmu_XD_JuT-k0pGw@mail.gmail.com>', 'lauraschx92@gmail.com', '2026-03-05 09:47:14', 'Re: Details & Preparation for Your Yoga TTC in Rishikesh', '<div dir=\"auto\">Hi Rudra,</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Thank you so much for your email and all the information.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">I’m very keen to come! Your ashram looks beautiful and so peaceful. I have looked at many yoga schools but this one stood out to me.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">It shows you only have shared or triple rooms available. Unfortunately I’m looking for somewhere where I could have a private room. This is because I have a medical condition that affects me at night. (I am happy to discuss in more detail). Is this something you can accommodate? </div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">With love &amp; blessings,</div><div dir=\"auto\">Laura </div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container\" dir=\"auto\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Thu, 5 Mar 2026 at 09:16, Adhiroha &lt;<a href=\"mailto:info@adhiroha.com\">info@adhiroha.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204)\"><div><div style=\"word-break:break-word;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><div style=\"word-break:break-word;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-break:break-word;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-break:break-word;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-break:break-word;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-break:break-word;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"width:100%;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;max-width:900px;padding:0px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;margin-bottom:20px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Aum Namaha Shivaya!</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Dear  Laura,</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I hope you are doing well.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">This is Rudra, your course counselor. I am here to guide you through your 200-Hour Yoga Teacher Training Course (YTTC) in November 2026. Here are the details to help you prepare:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"font-size:15px;padding-left:20px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">\r\n<li style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Duration: 24 Days</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Start Date: 1st  November 2026</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">End Date: 24th November 2026</li><li style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Arrival: 1 Day Before Course Starts</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Accommodation: Euros 1275 for Triple Sharing or Euros 1650 for Double Sharing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Please feel free to explore the 200 Hour Yoga TTC in Rishikesh details on our website or contact me directly with any questions. I am happy to help you understand the program, from what to expect at our Rishikesh ashram to the daily schedule.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I look forward to connecting with you and welcoming you to Adhiroha!</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:30px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Warm Regards,</span><br><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Rudra (Course Counsellor)</span><br><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"3\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">WhatsApp: +91-9999-048-900</font></span><br><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">The Adhiroha Team</span></p></div>\r\n</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><img src=\"https://mailer3.zohoinsights-crm.in/ocimage/2518b.df84765b4/mkfe008a70-1873-11f1-bdba-8e9a6c33ddc2_hk82cb14810c828133239948e257221850ff3acf65e27762acefbca9989a5eefdf.gif\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\"></div></blockquote></div></div>\r\n', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', ''),
(378, '14952', '<AMBPR07MB1063727222926ACBFF5F2B433EE78A@AMBPR07MB10637.eurprd07.prod.outlook.com>', 'spotter2005@hotmail.co.uk', '2026-03-08 17:30:36', 'Re: Adhiroha Yoga Ashram- Where the Himalayas Become Your Yoga Shala', '<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=Windows-1252\">\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">\r\nDear Rudra</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">\r\nApril is too soon for me....I would love to plan for the end of the year Nov/Dec time.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">\r\nI would also like to ask you if you think it would be ok for me to take the course, I suffer with spinal stenosis I am back into practising yoga but have had some time out due to life circumstances although iv practised yoga on &amp; off for just over 20 years\r\n &amp; do believe yoga &amp; my diet is helping. I so wish to do your course to help myself &amp; others in time. Firstly doing the course &amp; then hoping to specialise in pain management, this course I wish to take it easy &amp; I may not be able to do head stands etc but wish\r\n to teach to a certain level e.g beginners older people &amp; eventually people with pain issues??&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">\r\nDo you think your course could accommodate me? I know what poses I can &amp; cannot practice.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">\r\nMany Thanks, I look forward to hearing from you</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">\r\nSamantha x</div>\r\n<div id=\"ms-outlook-mobile-body-separator-line\" data-applydefaultfontstyles=\"true\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"ms-outlook-mobile-signature\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Sent from\r\n</span><a href=\"https://aka.ms/AAb9ysg\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Outlook for Android</a></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div id=\"divRplyFwdMsg\" dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:11pt\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> Adhiroha &lt;info@adhiroha.com&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Sunday, March 8, 2026 4:33:24 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> spotter2005@hotmail.co.uk &lt;spotter2005@hotmail.co.uk&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Adhiroha Yoga Ashram- Where the Himalayas Become Your Yoga Shala</font>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word; word-break:break-word; font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word; word-break:break-word\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word; word-break:break-word\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word; word-break:break-word\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word; word-break:break-word\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word; word-break:break-word\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n<div style=\"\">\r\n<div style=\"word-break:break-word\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n<div style=\"\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Aum Namaha Shivaya!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Dear {{First Name}},</p>\r\n<p style=\"\"><font face=\"Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Imagine waking before sunrise, Stepping onto your mat as soft mist drifts through the hills.<br>\r\n</font><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">A quiet river flowing beside the Ashram, Birdsong becoming your natural alarm clock.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">This is not a retreat moment; This is everyday life at Adhiroha.<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br>\r\nNestled in the Himalayan hills and surrounded by forest and wildlife, our environment naturally invites silence, focus, and inner awareness. Many of our students share that nature itself becomes their greatest teacher here.<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br>\r\nOur yoga teacher training is not rushed or commercial.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"\"><font face=\"Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">It is structured, disciplined, and grounded in traditional yogic living ? allowing you to truly experience yoga as a way of life, not just a certification.<br>\r\n</font><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br>\r\nIf this speaks to your heart, I would truly be happy to connect with you and answer any questions you may have.<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br>\r\nBest Wishes,<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Rudra (Course Counsellor)<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:small; background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">WhatsApp: +91-9999-048-900</span><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">The Adhiroha Team</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<img src=\"https://mailer3.zohoinsights-crm.in/ocimage/2518b.df84765b4/mk86fea970-1b0c-11f1-8368-cabf48e1bf81_hk045388a0ea43817da7af9ba8b5cf0283d1ad4413f8262dbf44732549517003f1.gif\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\"></div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', ''),
(379, '14943', '<CAKA2oN_yX+nbid-fcbCpWJnMOvbOJi5O1UXw=aWzhAOT0_Cxaw@mail.gmail.com>', 'jkillgour@gmail.com', '2026-03-09 08:54:16', 'Re: Complete Your Registration - 300 Hour Yoga Teacher Training Course - Adhiroha', '<div dir=\"auto\">Dear Team,<div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Really appreciate the follow up. I decided not to go forward with the registration.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Warm regards,</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Jacky Killgour </div><div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"mailto:jkillgour@gmail.com\">jkillgour@gmail.com</a></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, 9 Mar 2026, 7:51 pm Adhiroha Yoga Centre, &lt;<a href=\"mailto:info@adhiroha.com\">info@adhiroha.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n    <p>Aum Namaha Shivaya! <br><br>\r\n    Dear Jacqueline,</p>\r\n    <p>We noticed that you initiated the registration process for the 300 Hour Yoga Teacher Training Course in Rishikesh for the month of September 2026 but did not complete it. <br><br>\r\n    Is there any information or assistance you may be looking for to finalize your registration? We are here to help with any questions or concerns you might have.\r\n    <br><br>\r\n    If you prefer to discuss your questions over a voice or video call, we can arrange a Google Meet session. Please message us on WhatsApp for a quick call setup.\r\n    <br><br>\r\n    Please refer to the attached E-handbook of Adhiroha. It contains detailed information that will assist you in making an informed decision.\r\n    <br><br>\r\n    Best Wishes,<br>The Adhiroha Team</p>\r\n    <div>\r\n        <a href=\"https://adhiroha.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Website</a> |\r\n        <a href=\"https://instagram.com/adhiroha.yoga.centre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Instagram</a> |\r\n        <a href=\"https://facebook.com/adhirohayogacentre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Facebook</a> |\r\n        <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@Adhiroha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Youtube</a> |\r\n        <a href=\"https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=919999048900\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">WhatsApp</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top:0px;letter-spacing:0.5px\">\r\n        <strong style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">Adhiroha</strong> - a host to over 3000+ graduates to \r\n        <strong style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">explore Self-discovery</strong>! An exquisite haven of an \r\n        <strong style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">Expansive 3-acre Ashram</strong> amidst lush green mountains, \r\n        <strong style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">Natural Water Streams</strong> within the campus, \r\n        <strong style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">Premium Residences</strong>, \r\n        <strong style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">World-class Yogashalas</strong> &amp; a team of \r\n        <strong style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">Expert Yogacharyas</strong>!\r\n        <strong style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">RATED #1 Yoga School in India</strong> | \r\n        <strong style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">Ministry of Ayush, Govt. of INDIA</strong>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <img src=\"https://adhiroha.com/info/signature-mail.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px\">\r\n    \r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', ''),
(380, '14961', '<CAE6V8Bqm+q_E82K1MChqhu75Gb8zbXXpr8kERouxmMbG7Nb8Lw@mail.gmail.com>', 'm.gregoire13@gmail.com', '2026-03-11 20:59:44', 'Re: Details & Preparation for Your Yoga TTC in Rishikesh', '<div dir=\"auto\">Hi Rudra,</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Thank you for coming back to me. </div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">I would figure out this train oh courses as a meanîg to make me good and to then give lessons in France and/or in Belgium.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Would you have any idea as to know if my project is relevant ? On the shadow side I am saying to myself that there are so many yoga teachers in Europe that I am not sure if I can earn money with it. </div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Kind regards.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Michele </div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">Le mer. 11 mars 2026 à 21:43, Adhiroha &lt;<a href=\"mailto:info@adhiroha.com\">info@adhiroha.com</a>&gt; a écrit :<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;max-width:900px;padding:0px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;margin-bottom:20px\">Aum Namaha Shivaya!</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">Dear  Michele,</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">I hope you are doing well.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">This is Rudra, your course counselor. I am here to guide you through your 200-Hour Yoga Teacher Training Course (YTTC) in August 2026. Here are the details to help you prepare:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"font-size:15px;padding-left:20px\">\r\n<li>Duration: 24 Days</li>\r\n<li>Start Date: 1st  August 2026</li>\r\n<li>End Date: 24th August 2026</li><li>Arrival: 1 Day Before Course Starts</li>\r\n<li>Accommodation: Euros 1275 for Triple Sharing or Euros 1650 for Double Sharing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">Please feel free to explore the 200 Hour Yoga TTC in Rishikesh details on our website or contact me directly with any questions. I am happy to help you understand the program, from what to expect at our Rishikesh ashram to the daily schedule.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">I look forward to connecting with you and welcoming you to Adhiroha!</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Warm Regards,</span><br><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Rudra (Course Counsellor)</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font size=\"3\">WhatsApp: +91-9999-048-900</font></span><br><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The Adhiroha Team</span></p></div>\r\n</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><img src=\"https://mailer3.zohoinsights-crm.in/ocimage/2518b.df84765b4/mk03a3eb90-1d8b-11f1-a248-525400c92439_hk55ca5ec7e510f5ecbc8f2ad3cf96e56c25749b58fdf9d4b1e90dd975a8b1c4c5.gif\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\"></div></blockquote></div></div>\r\n', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', ''),
(381, '14984', '<CAK2Dp7utJpaw9EE5w+Na7c0eVwnDGw-RvWzThBp12niugV6HWg@mail.gmail.com>', 'nidhidevani26@gmail.com', '2026-03-16 04:14:48', 'Re: Details & Preparation for Your Yoga TTC in Rishikesh', '<div><br clear=\"all\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\">Hi </div></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\">Hope you are doing well </div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\">Can you please inform the fees structure in INR </div><div dir=\"auto\">Also are tge fees different for international student and Indian nationals ? </div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Kind Regards </div><div dir=\"auto\">Nidhi Devani </div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div><div class=\"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Sat, 14 Mar 2026 at 4:12 pm, Adhiroha &lt;<a href=\"mailto:info@adhiroha.com\">info@adhiroha.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;max-width:900px;padding:0 0px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">Aum Namaha Shivaya!</p>\r\n<p>Dear  Nidhi,</p>\r\n<p>I hope you are doing well.</p>\r\n<p>This is Rudra, your course counselor. I am here to guide you through your 500-Hour Yoga Teacher Training Course (YTTC) in April 2026. Here are the details to help you prepare:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"padding-left:20px\">\r\n<li>Duration: 60 Days</li>\r\n<li>Start Date: 1st  April 2026</li>\r\n<li>End Date: 29th of Following Month</li><li>Arrival: 1 Day Before Course Starts</li>\r\n<li>Accommodation: Euros 2790 for Triple Sharing or Euros 3690 for Double Sharing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Please feel free to explore the 500 Hour Yoga TTC in Rishikesh details on our website or contact me directly with any questions. I am happy to help you understand the program, from what to expect at our Rishikesh ashram to the daily schedule.</p>\r\n<p>I look forward to connecting with you and welcoming you to Adhiroha!</p>\r\n<hr style=\"margin:30px 0px;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;border-left:none;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(204,204,204)\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:30px\">Warm Regards,<br>Rudra (Course Counsellor<br>Whatsapp : +91-9999-048-900<br>The Adhiroha Team</p>\r\n<br></div>\r\n</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><img src=\"https://mailer3.zohoinsights-crm.in/ocimage/2518b.df84765b4/mk8817e670-1f92-11f1-994f-8e9a6c33ddc2_hk53eb70ba67dd7e350b94a36304a06a4d94744c79ca4b8aeca1e98c8578377649.gif\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\"></div></blockquote></div></div>\r\n', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', '');
