mal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; line-break: after-white-space;\"><font size=\"1\"><font color=\"#5a5b5b\"><a href=\"https://ambervanbossel.com/\">https://ambervanbossel.com/</a></font></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>Op 19 mrt 2026, om 23:34 heeft Adhiroha &lt;info@adhiroha.com&gt; het volgende geschreven:</div><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"><div><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><div style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word; font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><div><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Aum Namaha Shivaya!<br><br>Dear Amber,</p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><font face=\"Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Thank you for your interest in our Yoga Teacher Training Program in Rishikesh.</font></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Choosing the right yoga school is about much more than comparing course curriculums. It is about the environment you live in, the energy that surrounds you, and the space that supports your inner transformation.</span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Adhiroha is known as one of the biggest Yoga Teacher Training Schools in Rishikesh — and uniquely, the only school located in the hills, embraced by forest land and natural silence. Here, your learning is supported not only by experienced teachers, but also by the serenity of nature.</span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">I am happy to share our complete<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><b>Adhiroha E-Handbook</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>with you. Inside, you will find:</span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">•⁠&nbsp; ⁠Complete details of the Yoga Teacher Training course<br></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">•⁠&nbsp; ⁠Our daily yogic routine and ashram discipline<br></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">•⁠&nbsp; Information about satvik Ayurvedic meals and accommodation<br></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">•⁠&nbsp; ⁠Introduction to our teachers, certification, and course fees<br></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">•⁠&nbsp; ⁠Travel, visa, and arrival guidance</span></p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><font face=\"Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Please take your time to go through it peacefully. Once you’ve had a chance to read it, I would be happy to personally guide you and answer any questions you may have.</font></p><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font size=\"2\">Best Wishes,</font></div><div style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Rudra (Course Counsellor)</font><br><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">WhatsApp: +91-9999-048-900</font></font></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font size=\"2\">The Adhiroha Team</font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><img src=\"https://mailer3.zohoinsights-crm.in/ocimage/2518b.df84765b4/mkc978edd0-23e3-11f1-aa94-d2cf08f4ca8c_hk06d4f3b4cedd9dccb22afc8ede46019e24bee7d8c31b98abe294c416ee9af253.gif\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><span id=\"cid:7AF3FBB4-9EAC-4EF9-B686-88368B922B03\">&lt;e-handbook-adhiroha.pdf&gt;</span></div></blockquote></div><br></div></body></html>', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', ''),
(384, '15012', '<AMBP195MB3179FAFBFDA2249C82593E74F94CA@AMBP195MB3179.EURP195.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM>', 'clarecraig@live.co.uk', '2026-03-20 09:58:22', 'Re: Clare, Your Inquiry About The 200 Hour Yoga TTC', '<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">\r\nHi Rudra,</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">\r\nThankyou for the information.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">\r\nSo the cost of the double sharing room is €1423 which would be the cost for two people?&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">\r\nIt isnt per person?</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">\r\nThanks,</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Rob