ce-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n<div style=\"\">\r\n<div style=\"word-break:break-word\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n<div style=\"\">\r\n<div style=\"word-break:break-word\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n<div style=\"\">\r\n<div style=\"word-break:break-word\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n<div style=\"\">\r\n<div style=\"word-break:break-word\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style>\r\n<!--\r\n-->\r\n</style>\r\n<div style=\"\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Aum Namaha Shivaya!<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDear Clare,</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><font face=\"Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Thank you for your interest in our Yoga Teacher Training Program in Rishikesh.</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Choosing the right yoga school is about much more than comparing course curriculums. It is about the environment you live in, the energy that\r\n surrounds you, and the space that supports your inner transformation.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Adhiroha is known as one of the biggest Yoga Teacher Training Schools in Rishikesh — and uniquely, the only school located in the hills, embraced\r\n by forest land and natural silence. Here, your learning is supported not only by experienced teachers, but also by the serenity of nature.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">I am happy to share our complete\r\n<b>Adhiroha E-Handbook</b> with you. Inside, you will find:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">•⁠&nbsp; ⁠Complete details of the Yoga Teacher Training course<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">•⁠&nbsp; ⁠Our daily yogic routine and ashram discipline<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">•⁠&nbsp; Information about satvik Ayurvedic meals and accommodation<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">•⁠&nbsp; ⁠Introduction to our teachers, certification, and course fees<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">•⁠&nbsp; ⁠Travel, visa, and arrival guidance</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><font face=\"Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Please take your time to go through it peacefully. Once you’ve had a chance to read it, I would be happy to personally guide you and answer any questions\r\n you may have.</font></p>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<font size=\"2\" style=\"\">Best Wishes,</font></div>\r\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font size=\"2\" style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Rudra (Course Counsellor)</font><br>\r\n<font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">WhatsApp: +91-9999-048-900</font></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<font size=\"2\" style=\"\">The Adhiroha Team</font></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<img src=\"https://mailer3.zohoinsights-crm.in/ocimage/2518b.df84765b4/mk27fd02d0-2437-11f1-9d4c-62df313bf14d_hk278f38b230893395bdaa7527c23282374179bdaccd3ab319f64bcc1db6167b30.gif\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\"></div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', ''),
(385, '15023', '<CAGkQEJ6TyRYQNsma4NnhNK+tc8B+HTH2iktMO0ufYhf8-jRSsA@mail.gmail.com>', 'arijitsenc@gmail.com', '2026-03-22 08:20:29', 'Re: Details & Preparation for Your Yoga TTC in Rishikesh', '<div dir=\"auto\">Hi Rudra </div><div dir=\"auto\">I was thinking of the 12 days Pranayama and meditation course . What’s the price for that please ? </div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Regards </div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Sun, 22 Mar 2026 at 7:12 pm, Adhiroha &lt;<a href=\"mailto:info@adhiroha.com\">info@adhiroha.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;max-width:900px;padding:0px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;margin-bottom:20px\">Aum Namaha Shivaya!</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">Dear  Arijit,</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">I hope you are doing well.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">This is Rudra, your course counselor. I am here to guide you through your 200-Hour Yoga Teacher Training Course (YTTC) in April 2026. Here are the details to help you prepare:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"font-size:15px;padding-left:20px\">\r\n<li>Duration: 24 Days</li>\r\n<li>Start Date: 1st  April 2026</li>\r\n<li>End Date: 24th April 2026</li><li>Arrival: 1 Day Before Course Starts</li>\r\n<li>Accommodation: Euros 1275 for Triple Sharing or Euros 1650 for Double Sharing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">Please feel free to explore the 200 Hour Yoga TTC in Rishikesh details on our website or contact me directly with any questions. I am happy to help you understand the program, from what to expect at our Rishikesh ashram to the daily schedule.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">I look forward to connecting with you and welcoming you to Adhiroha!</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Warm Regards,</span><br><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Rudra (Course Counsellor)</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font size=\"3\">WhatsApp: +91-9999-048-900</font></span><br><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The Adhiroha Team</span></p></div>\r\n</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><img src=\"https://mailer3.zohoinsights-crm.in/ocimage/2518b.df84765b4/mkd8142ff0-25c6-11f1-994f-8e9a6c33ddc2_hkc9023d4a04761ce4e1492096f25f8e81bd0677807dd820cd592b43facecf1478.gif\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\"></div></blockquote></div></div>\r\n', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', ''),
(386, '15027', '<734873021.9158.1774342007506@libero.it>', 'tatianamit@libero.it', '2026-03-24 08:46:46', 'Re: Details & Preparation for Your Yoga TTC in Rishikesh', '<body>\r\n Hi Rudra, \r\n <br />\r\n <br />It’s ok if I arrive on July 30 at 12:40 pm at the Dehradun airport and I have the return flight on August 24 at 15:40 pm? \r\n <br />\r\n <br />Marysol, that just completed the course, told me that I have to tell you I’m a follower of hers community on instagram (@marysolgodoyflow) , my name is Tatiana Mititelu, if you need it. \r\n <br />\r\n <br />So I want to reserve the flights and the course as soon as possible 😊 I can’t wait to live this experience!\r\n <br />Could you give me all the payment details please? I want to share a triple room, thank you.\r\n <br />\r\n <br />Have a good day!\r\n <br />\r\n <br />Tatiana \r\n <br />\r\n <br />\r\n <br /> -- \r\n <br /> Inviato da Libero Mail\r\n <div final=\"\" class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n  <br />\r\n  <table style=\"width:100%;\">\r\n   <tbody>\r\n    <tr>\r\n     <td>Il 17 Marzo 2026, alle 06:42:45 UTC Adhiroha Yoga Ashram&lt;info@adhiroha.com&gt; ha scritto:<br /></td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n   </tbody>\r\n  </table>\r\n  <blockquote final=\"\" class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.8ex; border-left: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding-left: 1ex;\">\r\n   <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n    <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n     Aum Namaha Shivaya!\r\n     <br />\r\n     <br />Yes, August 1st to 24th is confirmed for the 200 Hour YTTC.\r\n     <br />\r\n     <br />Regarding flights, flying into New Delhi (DEL) is the usual route. Staying 1 or 2 days in Delhi before coming to Rishikesh is fine, but you will need to arrange your own transport from Delhi to Rishikesh afterwards. Alternatively we can arrange your pickup from Delhi at a charge of euros 120.\r\n     <br />\r\n     <br />Let us know if you have other questions.\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n     <br />\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div>\r\n     Best Wishes,\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div>\r\n     Rudra\r\n    </div>\r\n    <br />\r\n    <div class=\"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container\">\r\n     <div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">\r\n      On Tue, Mar 17, 2026 at 12:14 AM \r\n      <a href=\"mailto:tatianamit@libero.it\">tatianamit@libero.it</a> &lt;\r\n      <a href=\"mailto:tatianamit@libero.it\">tatianamit@libero.it</a>&gt; wrote:\r\n      <br />\r\n     </div>\r\n     <blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n      <div>\r\n        Dear Rudra, \r\n       <br /> \r\n       <br />I want to reserve for August 2026, could you help me with the flight choice? \r\n       <br /> \r\n       <br />I would visit New Delhi for 1 or 2 days before the yoga course, do you think it’s a good idea? \r\n       <br /> \r\n       <br />Thank you, \r\n       <br />Tatiana \r\n       <br /> \r\n       <br /> \r\n       <br /> -- \r\n       <br /> Inviato da Libero Mail \r\n       <div class=\"gmail_quote\"> \r\n        <br /> \r\n        <table style=\"width:100%\"> \r\n         <tbody> \r\n          <tr> \r\n           <td>Il 01 Marzo 2026, alle 07:33:45 UTC Adhiroha&lt;<a href=\"mailto:info@adhiroha.com\" target=\"_blank\">info@adhiroha.com</a>&gt; ha scritto:<br /></td> \r\n          </tr> \r\n         </tbody> \r\n        </table> \r\n        <blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"> \r\n         <div style=\"word-break:break-word;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"> \r\n          <div style=\"word-break:break-word\"> \r\n           <div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"> \r\n            <div style=\"word-break:break-word\"> \r\n             <div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"> \r\n              <div style=\"word-break:break-word\"> \r\n               <div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"> \r\n                <div style=\"word-break:break-word\"> \r\n                 <div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"> \r\n                  <div style=\"word-break:break-word\"> \r\n                   <div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"> \r\n                    <div style=\"width:100%\"> \r\n                     <div style=\"width:100%\"> \r\n                      <div style=\"width:100%;max-width:900px;padding:0px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:rgb(51,51,51)\"> \r\n                       <p style=\"font-size:15px;margin-bottom:20px\">Aum Namaha Shivaya!</p> \r\n                       <p style=\"font-size:15px\">Dear&nbsp; Tatiana,</p> \r\n                       <p style=\"font-size:15px\">I hope you are doing well.</p> \r\n                       <p style=\"font-size:15px\">This is Rudra, your course counselor. I am here to guide you through your 200-Hour Yoga Teacher Training Course (YTTC) in August 2026. Here are the details to help you prepare:</p> \r\n                       <ul style=\"font-size:15px;padding-left:20px\"> \r\n                        <li>Duration: 24 Days</li> \r\n                        <li>Start Date: 1st&nbsp; August 2026</li> \r\n                        <li>End Date: 24th&nbsp;August 2026</li> \r\n                        <li>Arrival: 1 Day Before Course Starts</li> \r\n                        <li>Accommodation: Euros 1275 for Triple Sharing or Euros 1650 for Double Sharing</li> \r\n                       </ul> \r\n                       <p style=\"font-size:15px\">Please feel free to explore the 200 Hour Yoga TTC in Rishikesh details on our website or contact me directly with any questions. I am happy to help you understand the program, from what to expect at our Rishikesh ashram to the daily schedule.</p> \r\n                       <p style=\"font-size:15px\">I look forward to connecting with you and welcoming you to Adhiroha!</p> \r\n                       <p style=\"margin-top:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Warm Regards,</span><br /><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Rudra (Course Counsellor)</span><br /><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font size=\"3\">WhatsApp: +91-9999-048-900</font></span><br /><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The Adhiroha Team</span></p> \r\n                      </div> \r\n                     </div> \r\n                    </div> \r\n                   </div> \r\n                  </div> \r\n                 </div> \r\n                </div> \r\n               </div> \r\n              </div> \r\n             </div> \r\n            </div> \r\n           </div> \r\n          </div> \r\n         </div> \r\n         <img src=\"https://mailer3.zohoinsights-crm.in/ocimage/2518b.df84765b4/mkf7c85e70-1540-11f1-80de-8e9a6c33ddc2_hk67a30cddf0b668aa69ea2bc1e4e0febc03be98e5a7ebb8e1eec087128c30e457.gif\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\" /> \r\n        </blockquote> \r\n       </div> \r\n      </div>\r\n     </blockquote>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div>\r\n     <br clear=\"all\" />\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div>\r\n     <br />\r\n    </div>\r\n    <span class=\"gmail_signature_prefix\">-- </span>\r\n    <br />\r\n    <div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\">\r\n     <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n      <div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">\r\n       Best Wishes,\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">\r\n       Rudra (Course Counsellor)\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">\r\n       The Adhiroha Team\r\n      </div>\r\n     </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n   </div> \r\n  </blockquote>\r\n </div>\r\n</body>', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', ''),
(387, '15041', '<CAAuCfXoe8DfUDEyj7=dhXZphdEV2LdY0FNGTfJy8TWLJw5gmFg@mail.gmail.com>', 'jillroberts@travelmation.net', '2026-03-26 03:11:40', 'Re: Secure Your Seat for Yoga Teacher Training at Adhiroha- Rishikesh', '<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(153,0,255)\">Namaste,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(153,0,255)\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(153,0,255)\">I have a client interested in your 500 hour course.  He would like to start on June 1, 2026.  I see the prices and how to enroll him on your website, my question is if he can pay with a credit card? or are the only options what I see online?  </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(153,0,255)\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(153,0,255)\">I&#39;d also like in inquire on if you pay commissions to travel agents. If so, what information would you need from my host company to pay them.  </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(153,0,255)\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(153,0,255)\">warm regards, </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(153,0,255)\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(153,0,255)\">Jill Roberts,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(153,0,255)\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(153,0,255)\">Travelmation</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wed, Mar 25, 2026 at 4:20 PM Adhiroha Yoga Centre &lt;<a href=\"mailto:info@adhiroha.com\">info@adhiroha.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">Aum Namaha Shivaya!\r\n\r\nDear Jill Roberts,\r\n\r\nGreetings from Adhiroha, Yoga school in Rishikesh. I hope this message finds you well.\r\n\r\nThis is Rudra, I&#39;ll be here to support and guide you through your yoga teacher training journey.\r\n\r\nAt Adhiroha, we offer three residential training programs:\r\n\r\n200 Hour YTTC – 24 Days – €1275 (Triple) / €1650 (Double)\r\n300 Hour YTTC – 30 Days – €1500 (Triple) / €2000 (Double)\r\n500 Hour YTTC – 60 Days – €2790 (Triple) / €3690 (Double)\r\n\r\nEach program begins on the 1st of every month.\r\n\r\nBest Wishes,\r\nRudra\r\nThe Adhiroha Team\r\n\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', ''),
(388, '15039', '<04B1DCF2-02F1-4382-ABC8-85F862A85697@gmail.com>', 'sam.smargiassi@gmail.com', '2026-03-26 14:42:34', 'Re: Adhiroha Yoga Ashram- Where the Himalayas Become Your Yoga Shala', '<html><head><meta http-equiv=\"content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"></head><body dir=\"auto\">Hello,<div>I hope to come November 2027. From what I can see, your school offers a peaceful atmosphere for the experience and as I weigh my options, it is a top contender, although it is priced on the higher end.&nbsp;<div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">Samantha&nbsp;</div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Mar 26, 2026, at 7:36 AM, Adhiroha &lt;info@adhiroha.com&gt; wrote:<br><br></blockquote></div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div dir=\"ltr\">﻿<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\"><div style=\"word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><div style=\"word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style></style>\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style></style>\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style></style>\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style></style>\r\n<div style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style></style>\r\n<div style=\"\"><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;charset=UTF-8\">\r\n<meta content=\"width=device-width\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n<style></style>\r\n<div style=\"\"><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Aum Namaha Shivaya!&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Dear {{First Name}},</p>\r\n<p style=\"\"><font face=\"Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Imagine waking before sunrise, Stepping onto your mat as soft mist drifts through the hills.<br></font><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">A quiet river flowing beside the Ashram, Birdsong becoming your natural alarm clock.</span></p><p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">This is not a retreat moment; This is everyday life at Adhiroha.<br></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br>Nestled in the Himalayan hills and surrounded by forest and wildlife, our environment naturally invites silence, focus, and inner awareness. Many of our students share that nature itself becomes their greatest teacher here.<br></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br>Our yoga teacher training is not rushed or commercial.</span></p><p style=\"\"><font face=\"Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">It is structured, disciplined, and grounded in traditional yogic living — allowing you to truly experience yoga as a way of life, not just a certification.<br></font><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br>If this speaks to your heart, I would truly be happy to connect with you and answer any questions you may have.<br></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br>Best Wishes,<br></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Rudra (Course Counsellor)<br></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">WhatsApp: +91-9999-048-900</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">The Adhiroha Team</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><img src=\"https://sender.zohoinsights.in/ocimage/2518b.df84765b4/mk23a68050-2921-11f1-a248-525400c92439_hka93f186e9907308687da3d60021c5f19310c5e5a8bcf5294b75ea1b5a5b45cab.gif\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\" data-unique-identifier=\"\"></div></blockquote></div></body></html>', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', ''),
(389, '15059', '<CAG5ynjL1obzObeq0F4MDuhZA5Ztnisb2sg72kXSJTM9Ff0wF1Q@mail.gmail.com>', 'agnasbibin@gmail.com', '2026-03-29 16:57:33', 'Re: Details & Preparation for Your Yoga TTC in Rishikesh', '<div dir=\"auto\">Hi Rudra,<div dir=\"auto\">How much is the course fee?</div><div dir=\"auto\">Regards,</div><div dir=\"auto\">Agnas</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote gmail_quote_container\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, 30 Mar 2026, 12:53 am Adhiroha, &lt;<a href=\"mailto:info@adhiroha.com\">info@adhiroha.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word;font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana,arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;max-width:900px;padding:0px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;margin-bottom:20px\">Aum Namaha Shivaya!</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">Dear  Agnas,</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">I hope you are doing well.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">This is Rudra, your course counselor. I am here to guide you through your 200-Hour Yoga Teacher Training Course (YTTC) in November 2026. Here are the details to help you prepare:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"font-size:15px;padding-left:20px\">\r\n<li>Duration: 24 Days</li>\r\n<li>Start Date: 1st  November 2026</li>\r\n<li>End Date: 24th November 2026</li><li>Arrival: 1 Day Before Course Starts</li>\r\n<li>Accommodation: Euros 1275 for Triple Sharing or Euros 1650 for Double Sharing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">Please feel free to explore the 200 Hour Yoga TTC in Rishikesh details on our website or contact me directly with any questions. I am happy to help you understand the program, from what to expect at our Rishikesh ashram to the daily schedule.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size:15px\">I look forward to connecting with you and welcoming you to Adhiroha!</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Warm Regards,</span><br><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Rudra (Course Counsellor)</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font size=\"3\">WhatsApp: +91-9999-048-900</font></span><br><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The Adhiroha Team</span></p></div>\r\n</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><img src=\"https://sender.zohoinsights.in/ocimage/2518b.df84765b4/mk9a89bf50-2b76-11f1-bd46-62df313bf14d_hk2729156fad3ddab1459d63968a373995c4efdf7b610eb8e5099ce82533b7d711.gif\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\"></div></blockquote></div>\r\n', 0, 'incoming', 'not replied', '');
