(15, 'Aum Namaha Shivaya!\n\n\nOur program is specifically designed to cover the traditional and authentic teachings of yoga. So rest assured you will get the most appropriate level of yoga training. Our education quality standards is perhaps the best in the yoga industry, here Adhiroha stands out at a global level.\n\nWe are one of among the most expensive because of the facility we have. The best of the amenities and the biggest yoga school in the entire Rishikesh. Absolutely in the middle of nature, surrounded by forest in a 3 acre land. Unless others which they all are located in vertical buildings.\n\nAll our teachers are yoga acharyas or they have done masters degree in the field of yoga, the finest team of teachers in the town. For every subject we have a dedicated teacher.  \n\nThe experience you’ll have at Adhiroha is truly unmatched by any other yoga school in India. You can explore the testimonials from our students on Google reviews, watch video stories on our website, and visit our Instagram page for more insights.\n\nTake a moment to reflect and make a thoughtful, informed decision. Your time at Adhiroha will stay with you for a lifetime—think of it as an investment in yourself, not an expense.\n\nWishing you a peaceful day ahead.\n\n______________________________________________________________\n\n\n* Registration Started \n\nSubject:  Complete Your 200 Hour YTTC Registration \n\nWe noticed your interest in the [Course] Hour Yoga Teacher Training Course scheduled for [Month, Year], and we wanted to check if you need any assistance to reserve your seat. Please reply to this thread to let us know how we can support you in navigating your options and making your plans. \nIf you prefer to discuss your questions over a voice or video call, we can arrange a Google Meet session. Please message us on WhatsApp for a quick call setup.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Multiple Registration Started \n\nSubject: Complete Your 200 Hour YTTC Registration \n\nWe hope this message finds you in peace and reflection.\nWe wanted to remind you of your journey towards self-discovery with our [Course] Yoga Teacher Training Course (YTTC) at Adhiroha. It seems you\'ve started the registration process a few times, but the timing hasn\'t quite aligned.\n\nAt Adhiroha, we honour each person\'s unique path and rhythm. We know that starting a transformative journey is personal, and we\'re here to support you every step of the way.\nIf you have any uncertainties or hesitations, we are here to listen and assist in any way we can. Your journey is important, and we want to help it unfold in a way that feels right for you.\n\nCompleting your registration signifies a commitment to your growth and well-being, and we\'re here to nurture that commitment. Your journey is significant, and we\'re honoured to be part of it.\n\nPlease reach out if you have any questions or need further support. \n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Website Visit  \n\nSubject: Discover the Ultimate Yoga Teacher Training Experience in India \n\nWe\'re glad to connect with you and excited about your interest in starting your yogic journey!\n\nAs India\'s Most Preferred Yoga School, we invite you to join us. Let us know your preferred month to enrol, and we\'ll guide you through the next steps. Visit www.adhiroha.com for more details.\n\nShare what inspires you about yoga, your expectations from our Yoga TTC program, and any questions you have about Adhiroha\'s role in your journey.\n\nReply here or connect us via WhatsApp HERE for quick assistance.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Short Duration Course \n\nSubject: Begin Your Spiritual Journey with Our Divine Yoga Course\n\nIf you\'re ready to start practicing yoga or deepen your practice, and seeking a spiritual experience in a short getaway, our Divine Yoga Course is perfect for you! It\'s a 5-night, 6-day program starting at Euros 399 (Triple Sharing | All-Inclusive), available from the 24th to the 29th of every month in Rishikesh.\n\nVisit our website www.adhiroha.com and let us know if you need any assistance planning your yogic journey. We look forward to welcoming you!\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Sound Healing Teacher Training | Rishikesh | India \n\nSubject: Discover Sound Healing Teacher Training Course\n\nWe\'re thrilled that you\'re interested in our Sound Healing Teacher Training Course! It\'s a 5-night, 6-day program starting at 690 Euros (Triple Sharing | All-Inclusive), available from the 24th to the 29th of every month. For more information and registration details, please visit our website at www.adhiroha.com\n\nLet us know if you need any assistance to help you plan your journey. We look forward to welcoming you!\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Iyengar Yoga query \n\nSubject: Explore our Multi Style Traditional Yoga Teacher Training Course\n\nOur yoga courses seamlessly blend the traditional styles of Hatha and Ashtanga Vinyasa styles and incorporate Iyengar Yoga principles with props like blocks, belts, chairs, and walls. These are used in Adjustment and Alignment classes to enhance your understanding and teaching skills, complementing your practice and profile.\n\nWhether you choose our 200-hour, 300-hour, or 500-hour TTC programs, they provide a perfect environment to immerse yourself in yoga, integrate it into your daily life, and become a certified instructor globally. Explore more about each program through our website www.adhiroha.com. \n\nPlease review the details thoroughly, and we can connect here to address any questions you may have. Looking forward to welcoming you!\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n*Cancellation Policy Reply \n\nSubject: Important Update Regarding Cancellation of Course\n\nWe hope you are well. We regret that you are unable to join our course at this time.\nPlease note that all fees paid are non-refundable and non-transferable as per our policy. For more details, refer to the code of conduct on our website. The option available to you is to join the course within the next six months, and we will adjust your registration fee accordingly.\n\nIf you decide to join us in the coming months, please confirm your enrolment at your earliest convenience. Feel free to reach out if you have any questions or concerns.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Near Month End – Closing \n\nSubject: Enrolment Reminder: September Course Closing Soon!\n\nWe hope this email finds you well!\n\nWe wanted to remind you that enrolment for the August session is closing soon. If you\'re still interested in joining, there are only a few seats left available for the upcoming month.\nPlease let us know if you\'re considering enrolment or if you\'ve made other plans. We would like to hear about your decision and experience.\n\nFeel free to reach out if you have any questions or concerns.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n*Cab Questions \n\nSubject: Smooth Transportation Options to Our Rishikesh Ashram\n\nHope you\'re well.\n\nWe\'re pleased to provide a taxi service from Delhi International Airport to our Ashram in Rishikesh for 120 euros. This reliable service ensures a comfortable journey with a fixed price through our trusted cab agency.\n\nAlternatively, if you\'re flying into Delhi International Airport and prefer a more convenient option, we recommend booking a flight to Dehradun Airport. Upon arrival at Dehradun Airport, we will arrange pickup for you at no additional cost.\n\nLet us know your preference so we can ensure a smooth arrival at our Ashram. We look forward to welcoming you.\n\nAt the end of your course, transportation back to Dehradun Airport can be arranged for 1600 INR.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Are Private Accommodations/single rooms possible?\n\nWe understand your concerns about personal space. Our premium accommodations are designed to be comfortable while fostering a sense of community, which aligns with the yogic and spiritual lifestyle you\'ll experience here. While we encourage shared living for students, private accommodations can be available upon request with the fee structure of Euros 3800, while double sharing will cost you only Euros 2000.\n\nIncluded in the program fees are:\n\nStay: Premium mountain-view rooms with hot water and en-suite washrooms\nFood: Daily nutritious vegetarian meals three times a day\nPickup cab from Dehradun Airport\nStudy materials and Welcome Kit\nWeekly Excursion\nSound Healing Session\n\nExplore images of our residential wing here to get a feel for our accommodations. Feel free to reach out if you have any questions or concerns. \n\nFees for private room: \n200 Hour: 3000 Euros\n300 Hour: 3600 Euros  \n500 Hour: 6600 Euros\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Registration fees in INR (Included within the fees, balance fees to be paid upon arrival in the Ashram)\n\n200 hour 27000\n300 hours 45000\n500 hours 67500\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Extra night at a charge \n\n2100 INR (Triple Sharing Accommodation, All meals inclusive)\n2700 INR (Double Sharing Accommodation, All meals inclusive)\n4200 INR (Single Private Accommodation, All meals inclusive)\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Currency Accepted:   USD, Euros\n\nYou can settle the remaining fees using cash or card or bank transfer. Please be aware that a 5% bank transaction fee applies for card payments. 4% bank charge in case of bank transfers. No conversion charge on cash payments.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Around Subjects & Curriculum \n\nSubject: Dive into Our Comprehensive Yoga Curriculum\n\nOur ashram\'s daily curriculum is meticulously designed to fully immerse you in the practice of yoga. The day typically begins with Shatkarma practices around 6 AM, aimed at cleansing and preparing the body for the day ahead. Throughout the day, you will engage in a comprehensive range of subjects, including:\n\nPranayama: Techniques for breath control and regulation.\nAsanas: Multi-style yoga sessions encompassing Ashtanga Vinyasa and Hatha yoga, focusing on postures and sequences.\nMeditation: Practices to cultivate inner stillness and mindfulness.\nYogic Philosophy: Study of ancient texts and philosophical foundations of yoga.\nYoga Anatomy: Understanding the body\'s structure and its relevance to yoga practice.\nAlignment and Adjustments: Techniques from Iyengar Yoga to refine postures and ensure correct alignment.\nBasics of Ayurveda: Introduction to the principles of Ayurvedic medicine and lifestyle.\n\nClasses typically conclude around 7:30 PM, offering a structured yet immersive experience aimed at deepening your understanding and practice of yoga in all its dimensions.\n\nFeel free to reply with your further queries or you can directly register through our website www.adhiroha.com to secure your seat.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Language barrier/Is the course offered in any other language?\n\nPlease note that while fluency in English is not required, a basic understanding is sufficient, as most of our students come from non-English speaking countries. Our instructors are experienced in accommodating language limitations and ensure effective communication. Currently, the course is not offered in (XXX language).\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Laundry Facility\n\nWe have a tie-up with a vendor for laundry services, with charges at INR 20 per cloth.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Visa Link This is the link for the Indian Visa https://indianvisaonline.gov.in/\n\nThank you for your response and considering our program.\n\nRegarding your visa inquiry, students typically apply for a tourist visa for the duration of the training or if they plan to travel and explore after completing the course. You can refer to the Indian Visa application process at this link: Indian Visa Application.\nFor better and accurate guidance, you can also contact your travel agent.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Alternate Payment method : Bank Transfer\n\nBank - Axis Bank\nAccount Name: Adhiroham\nAccount number: 922020012766403\nBank Branch Address: Dehradun Road. Rishikesh. \nIFS code/ IBAN: UTIB0000156\nType: Current Account\nSwift code-AXISINBB093\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Batch Size in Rishikesh: \n\n200 Hour - 15 to 18\n300 Hour - 5 to 7\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Detailed breakdown of 200 Hour course\n\nThat\'s great to hear you\'re considering joining our [Course]-hour yoga teacher training course. We\'re excited about the transformative journey ahead.\n\nHere are the details:\n\nThe nearest international airport to our location is Delhi Airport. From there, you can take a flight to Dehradun Airport, where we\'ll arrange a cab for you. The cab fare from Dehradun Airport to the Ashram is included in the total program fees.\n\nThe course costs 1275 Euros for triple sharing accommodation and 1650 Euros for twin sharing accommodation. This includes comprehensive program features such as course materials, teachings, and enriching experiences.\n\nTo secure your spot, we require a deposit of 300 Euros. Seats are allocated on a first-come, first-served basis, so we recommend making the payment promptly to ensure all arrangements are in place for your stay and learning experience.\n\nWe can provide you with a detailed course breakdown upon request. The daily schedule begins with Shatkarma at 5:45 AM and concludes with classes ending around 7:30 PM. \n\nSubjects covered include: INSERT INTO `notes` (`id`, `note`) VALUES
