(43, 'Jaishree Birla', '7674971868', 'jaishree.birla@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha and Prenatal & Postnatal Yoga', '4', '300 hours and Prenatal and Postnatal - Vinyasa Yoga Ashram', 'I teach classical Hatha Yoga with a emphasis on alignement, breath awarness and mindful movement. My philosophy views as a holistic discilpline that cultivates physical stability, mental clarity and inner balance through consistent and conscious pratice. \r\nAlong with general Hatha Yoga, I have experience guiding gentle and Therapeutic practices, pariculary supportive for women\'s health, stress ,management, and nervoucs system regulation. ', '3.jpeg', 'Jaishree Yoga teacher.pdf', '16-12-2025 13:05:24'),
