(45, 'Gaurav Mehta ', '7018509855', 'gaurav790mehta@gmail.com', 'India ', 'Hath, ashtanga Vinyasa , Soundhealing ', '10 years', 'Hath yoga 200 RYT Ashtanga Vinyasa 500 RYT , Sound Healing ', 'I’m a passionate Yoga Instructor and Sound Healer with over 10 years of teaching experience and 24 years of self-practice. I specialize in Hatha, Ashtanga, Vinyasa, and Restorative Yoga, blending freestyle movement, martial arts-inspired flows, and animal flow techniques to create dynamic and mindful sessions.\r\n\r\nMy classes emphasize alignment, safety, and individual attention, helping each student grow with confidence. I’ve worked with both international and national clients, conducting all my classes in English. I also integrate Sound Healing and Music Therapy to promote relaxation and holistic well-being.\r\n\r\nGuided by sincerity, compassion, and a love for yoga, I aim to share this ancient knowledge globally and continue learning along the way.\r\n\r\nOpen to collaborations with wellness centers, yoga retreats, and resorts that value authentic, heart-centered teaching.', 'att._fm_0GYbVjuXvYdYqaaFphwz2lmJqlOrV3W8Oy2Z_pM.jpeg', 'Gaurav Mehta .pdf', '19-12-2025 14:01:11'),
