(61, 'Shubhanshi Aggarwal', '+919759504775', 'radhikaaggarwal294@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha yoga , Ashtanga yoga , philosophy', 'Online based 6 offline 2', 'Persuing P.hd in yoga science and completed Yttc 300hr from AYM school rishikesh ', 'My teaching style is holistic, disciplined, and compassionate. I integrate traditional Hatha and Ashtanga practices with yogic philosophy, breath awareness, and mindful alignment. My aim is to create safe, transformative classes that nurture physical strength, mental clarity, and inner awareness.', 'IMG-20250924-WA0009.jpg', 'shubhanshi aggarwal CV.pdf', '11-01-2026 13:57:01'),
