(78, 'Ram Avatar', '+91 99975 06477', 'www.yogiram.yoga@gmail.com', 'India', 'Traditional Yoga: Hatha, Ashtanga, and Vinyasa Flow. Specialized Techniques: Pranayama, Yoga Nidra, and Shatkarma.', '8years', 'Yoga Certificate in Yogic Science from Dev Sanskriti Vishwavidyalaya (Shantikunj)', 'Dedicated and highly skilled Yoga Professional with a certificate in Yogic science from Dev Sanskriti Vishwavidyalaya (Shantikunj). Possesses over 5 years of international teaching experience in Russia, specializing in traditional Hatha Yoga, Vinyasa Flow, and Meditative practices. Proven track record of helping diverse international clients achieve physical fitness, mental clarity, and spiritual growth.\r\nLanguages: English (Fluent), Hindi (Native), Russian (Conversational).\r\n', '01.jpg', '01.pdf', '24-02-2026 13:52:17'),
