(82, 'Sheetal Kumari ', '7281904185', 'pathaksheetal75@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha', '2', 'The yoga Institue ', 'My yoga teaching style is calm, alignment-focused, and breath-led. I guide students step-by-step, offering modifications so beginners feel safe and advanced students feel challenged.\r\n\r\nMy philosophy is that yoga is not just about flexibility, but about balance of body, mind, and soul. Inspired by the wisdom of Patanjali, I believe yoga is a lifestyle built on awareness, discipline, and inner peace. 🕉✨', '13B5CBCD-67C3-49B5-BF02-38A547450C8F.jpeg', '500hourTTC.pdf', '27-02-2026 18:04:17');
