(83, 'Vishal Chaturvedi ', '07389695267', 'vishal.10feb2001@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha, ashtanga vinyasa.', '1 year.', '200hr. YTTC in rishikesh. And completed Bachelor\'s and Master\'s with YOGA specialization. ', 'I like to teach hatha yoga and ashtanga with some flows and add some isotonic movements .\r\nAnd followed with pranayam and meditation.', 'IMG_20251109_082241.jpg', 'Resume final.pdf', '27-02-2026 22:45:07'),
(84, 'Shubham Sharma ', '8476914275', 'vbsshubhamsharma@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha', '5', 'MA yoga', 'With over five years of teaching experience in Hatha Yoga, my approach is rooted in traditional yogic principles while adapting to the individual needs of each student. I believe in guiding students through a slow, mindful, and alignment-focused practice that allows the body to open gradually and safely.\r\n\r\nIn a Teacher Training environment, I emphasize understanding over imitation. I encourage students to connect breath with movement, observe anatomical awareness, and understand the purpose behind each asana rather than just performing it.\r\n\r\nI gently integrate yogic philosophy into the practice, helping students experience yoga as a complete path — cultivating discipline, awareness, and inner transformation. As a teacher, I am continuously learning and evolving, and I bring that same spirit of growth into the classroom.\r\n\r\nMy intention is to create a grounded and authentic space where students from different cultures feel supported in deepening both their practice and their understanding of yoga.\r\n', '1758086861113.jpg', 'SHUBHAM SHARMA.pdf', '03-03-2026 18:42:27'),
(85, 'sanjay yadav ', '8468959160', 'sanjaygoa21@gmail.com', 'india', 'Hath yoga ', '0', 'PG from Gurukul kangdi vishwavidyalaya ', 'My teaching style is calm and supportive, focusing on breath awareness, proper alignment, and helping students connect their mind and body through yoga.” 🧘‍♂️', 'IMG_9232.jpeg', 'Resume.pdf', '08-03-2026 11:11:58'),
