(94, 'Himanshi Patel', '+12508792251', 'himanshi.patel11@gmail.com', 'India', 'Trauma-Informed Yoga - Gentle, Hatha & Yin', '5', '300 HR YTT Karma Teachers Association- Vancouver Canada', 'Compassionate trauma-informed yoga teacher having over 5+years of experience in curating and leading the classes in group and private settings. My goal has always been to create a space where people can meet themselves and go beyond just the physical practice of yoga. I come to this work not just as a teacher but as a seeker as well.', 'IMG_0369.jpeg', 'Himanshi_Patel_Yoga_Resume.pdf', '31-03-2026 20:55:37'),
