(103, 'Shivani Singh', '7861010560', 'shivani9singh786@gmail.com', 'India', 'Ashtanga, hatha , chair , face , meditation, relaxation techniques ', '10 year but in and off ', 'YYT 200hr from Bodhi school of yoga ', 'Clam and slow pace voice that soothes mind and body , with yoga postures that u feel comfortable but steady to goal , yoga personally changes everything around u and change your minds capacity to unlock new experience, alignments of mind and body helps the body to live longer stay strong , build strength in mind and body , I m just beginners in yoga as a teacher but have past 10 years of experience teaching, and performing sadhna , due to some drop I have to regain my strength but will do in 1 week hope you find me well for your place thank you 😊', 'IMG20260503190550.jpg', 'Shivani_Singh_Yoga_Resume.pdf', '03-05-2026 20:04:13'),
(104, 'Harsha', '8999234950', 'harsha.ashtewale@gmail.com', 'India ', 'Hatha/ vinyasa/ pranayama', '2', '200 hr (Aadi yoga school) 300hr (World peace yoga)', 'My teaching style is simple- easy to understand and remember. I believe in proper alignment than getting into the posture', 'D992263E-C77B-4099-9E43-03FCA469660A.jpeg', 'Harsha Yoga CV.pdf', '05-05-2026 11:56:35'),
