(106, 'Srishti Saxena', '07457001486', 'srishti16saxena@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha yoga', '3', 'Diploma in Yogic Science and YCB Level 3', 'I teach yoga as a gentle path to balance, strength, and self-awareness. My classes focus on mindful movement, breathwork, and creating a safe space where students can relax, build strength, and reconnect with themselves. I believe yoga should be simple, sustainable, and accessible for every body. ', 'IMG_20240407_081758.jpg', 'DocScanner 4 Dec 2025 9-42 pm-3.pdf', '08-05-2026 11:47:39'),
(107, 'Muskan Gill ', '7455929421', 'Gillmuskan2002@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha yoga, yin and restorative practices ', '2 ', '200hr yoga teacher training course ', 'My teaching style focuses on creating a safe, supportive, and mindful environment where students can connect with their body and breath. I believe yoga is not about perfection, but about balance, awareness, and personal growth. I adapt my classes according to individual needs and encourage students to practice with patience and consistency.', 'photo-output.jpeg', 'Yoga Guru_Therapist.pdf', '13-05-2026 17:34:59'),
(108, 'Priya Pundir', '6398365257', 'priyapundir707@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha ', '1', 'Yttc 200 , Masters in Yogic Science ', 'My teaching style is student-centered and supportive. I focus on proper alignment, breath awareness, and creating a calm environment', 'IMG_20250710_172233.jpg', 'Yoga Instructor Resume (1).pdf', '25-05-2026 15:01:21'),
(109, 'Himank Chauhan', '8091330339', 'himankchauhan.25@gmail.com', 'India', 'Aashtanga yoga, Hatha Yoga, Therapeutic yoga, Pre- Post Natal yog, Face Yoga', '5 years', 'Ycb level-6, Yoga Therapist- The Yoga Institue', 'The teaching approach is grounded in the traditional principles of Yoga while remaining responsive to the needs of contemporary practitioners. Sessions integrate asana, pranayama, meditation, yogic philosophy, and therapeutic applications, with an emphasis on creating a balanced, mindful, and transformative learning experience. Whether working with beginners, advanced practitioners, teacher trainees, or individuals seeking therapeutic support, instruction is adapted to the unique needs of each student. The use of props, modifications, and individualized methodologies ensures that the practice remains accessible, safe, and meaningful for all.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the teaching process lies the intention to help students understand and experience the deeper principles of Yoga. Emphasis is placed on building a strong foundation and cultivating awareness of the relationship between one\'s inner and outer world. Through experiential learning, students are encouraged to move beyond the mere execution of techniques and develop a genuine connection with the wisdom of Yoga in their daily lives.\r\n\r\nRooted in traditional yogic values while remaining practical and relevant to modern life, the ultimate objective is to inspire students not just to practice Yoga, but to live Yoga.', 'HC doc.jpg', 'HIMANK CHAUHAN_20260503_105834_0000.pdf', '30-05-2026 22:48:07'),
(110, 'Anuradha Bhatt ', '+91- 8868072408', '24anubhatt@gmail.com', 'India', 'Therapeutic yoga, meditation and pranayam ', '1 yr ', 'B.sc yoga ', 'Therapeutic Yoga Instructor skilled in therapeutic yoga, joint mobility exercises, asanas, stretching, pranayama, meditation, yogic kriyas, Yoga Nidra, and basic aqua yoga. Experienced in designing safe and effective sessions with appropriate modifications based on individual health needs and contraindications.', '17802978269423200755480830220769.jpg', 'Anuradha.pdf_20260316_125522_0000.pdf', '01-06-2026 12:40:58'),
(111, 'Harshita Jain', '9310544640', 'jainharshita122@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha and ashtanga ', '01 ', 'Masters in Yoga Therapy from Dev Sanskriti University, Haridwar', 'My teaching style focuses on Hatha Yoga, Ashtanga Yoga along with guiding individuals toward balance, awareness, and inner harmony through thoughtfully designed sessions tailored to their needs. Also, I have extensive knowledge of mindful mediation techniques, guided visualisation, pranayama breathwork and stress reduction techniques.', 'IMG_5906.jpeg', 'Resume .pdf', '02-06-2026 11:40:08'),
(112, 'om dutt sharma', '9557080175', 'omdutt.sharma30@gmail.com', 'India', 'Transcendental Meditation ', '10 years.', 'Maharishi v.v.v.v. peetham Maharishi Nagar Noida.', 'Effortless spontaneous technic ', 'IMG_20260601_170313757_HDR.jpg', 'Anuj Bio Data latest-1.pdf', '04-06-2026 14:37:59'),
(113, 'RAJEEV KUMAR', '7906073964', 'rajeevkumar1687@gmail.com', 'india', 'Yin Yoga, Ashtanga primary series', '3', 'Post Graduate in yoga by UoU, Uttarakhand', 'My yoga style is an adaptable, holistic blend of mindfulness, breathwork, stillnesss movement and more towards to the Union of body, Mind, Soul. The dynamic flow (Ashtanga/Vinyasa) builds strength and passive holds (Yin/Restorative) releases deep-seated tension. Yoga is the union of breath, physical movement, and spiritual awareness. It is about listening to your internal landscape.', 'croped (2).JPG', 'adiroha yoga resume.pdf', '05-06-2026 18:38:57'),
(114, 'Tripti ', '6399952259', 'triptikapoor19jul@gmail.com', 'India', 'Vinyasa/Hatha', '2.5 years of experience ', '200hrs of Vinyasa/Ashtanga', '\"I teach Vinyasa, Hatha, and Deep Relaxation yoga with a focus on mindful movement, breath awareness, and overall well-being. My philosophy is to create a welcoming environment where students of all levels can develop strength, flexibility, balance, and inner peace while honoring their individual needs and abilities.\"', 'Photo.jpg', 'Cv.pdf', '06-06-2026 17:46:59'),
(115, 'Tripti ', '6399952259', 'triptikapoor19jul@gmail.com', 'India ', 'Vinyasa Flow/Hatha', '2.5years of experience ', '200 hrs of Vinyasa/Ashtanga from Vinyasa Yoga Ashram', '\"I teach Vinyasa, Hatha, and Deep Relaxation yoga with a focus on mindful movement, breath awareness, and overall well-being. My philosophy is to create a welcoming environment where students of all levels can develop strength, flexibility, balance, and inner peace while honoring their individual needs and abilities.\"', 'Photo.jpg', 'Cv.pdf', '06-06-2026 17:50:21'),
(116, 'Sankalp parashar ', '8439946104', 'sankalpparashar23@gmail.com', 'India', 'Ashans, pranayam, meditation and astang yog ', '3 years ', 'YTA(HSSQ4000)', 'Whatever I teach, my students should understand it quickly and correctly in minimum time.', 'IMG-20260607-WA0022.jpg', 'Image to PDF 20260607 08.54.11.pdf', '07-06-2026 09:15:58'),
(117, 'Tripti ', '6399952259', 'triptikapoor19jul@gmail.com', 'India ', 'Vinyasa/Hatha', '3 years of experience ', '200hours', 'My teaching style combines Vinyasa, Hatha, Meditation, and Pranayama. In Vinyasa classes, I focus on creating a mindful flow that links movement with breath, helping students build strength, flexibility, and concentration. Through Hatha yoga, I emphasize proper alignment, steady practice, and awareness.My goal is to create a welcoming and supportive environment where students can explore yoga as a holistic practice for physical health, mental calmness, and personal growth.', 'Photo.jpg', 'Curriculum.pdf', '08-06-2026 11:56:46'),
(118, 'Shubham Chamoli', '9997605554', 'csarika615@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha , Iyengar', '8+', 'BSC and MSC in Yoga Therapy, 500 hrs TTC , Yog Upasana by Ravi Bisht', 'Therapeutic, adaptive and philosophy based.', 'ddcb3113-e44b-459e-b231-3a8e0c483eff.jpeg', 'Shubham’s cv n.pdf', '08-06-2026 13:02:38'),
(119, 'Shubham Chamoli', '9997605554', 'csarika615@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha , Iyengar', '8+', 'BSC and MSC in Yoga Therapy, 500 hrs TTC , Yog Upasana by Ravi Bisht', 'Therapeutic, adaptive and philosophy based.', 'ddcb3113-e44b-459e-b231-3a8e0c483eff.jpeg', 'Shubham’s cv n.pdf', '08-06-2026 13:59:21'),
(120, 'Shubhanshi Aggarwal', '9759504775', 'radhikaaggarwal294@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha, philosophy ', '3', '500 hr yttc AYM school Rishikesh ', 'As a yoga practitioner and teacher, I view yoga as a path of self-discovery and inner awakening. My teaching combines traditional Hatha Yoga, pranayama, meditation, and yogic philosophy to help students develop physical well-being, mental clarity, and spiritual growth. I strive to create a nurturing space where students can connect with their authentic selves, cultivate mindfulness, and experience balance both on and off the mat. My approach honors the ancient teachings of yoga while making them accessible for modern practitioners.', 'b57d5f01-a22a-4444-9eec-95d36b4e3189.jpeg', 'shubhanshi Aggarwal cv 2.pdf', '09-06-2026 00:07:58'),
(121, 'Nitish kumar', '89204699q0', 'guptalabsmedpoint@gmail.com', 'India', 'No', 'No teaching experience ', '200 and 300 from AYM', 'Actually i want to work as a volunteer , where i want to sharp my skill and serve to humanity as well', 'IMG_20260324_082617.jpg', 'Nitish_Gupta_Premium_NHS_CV.pdf', '09-06-2026 20:04:17'),
(122, 'Sankalp parashar ', '8439946104', 'sankalpparashar23@gmail.com', 'India', 'Ashans,pranayam,astang yog and meditation ', '3 years', 'YTA(HSSQ 4000)', 'Whatever I teach, I want my students to understand it correctly and in the shortest possible time.', 'Screenshot_20260610-065039~2.png', 'Image to PDF 20260607 08.54.11.pdf', '10-06-2026 06:58:53'),
(123, 'Tripti ', '6399952259', 'triptikapoor19jul@gmail.com', 'India ', 'Vinyasa/Hatha/Yin', '4years of experience ', '200 hours of Vinyasa/Ashtanga ', 'My teaching style combines Vinyasa, Hatha, Meditation, and Pranayama. In Vinyasa classes, I focus on creating a mindful flow that links movement with breath, helping students build strength, flexibility, and concentration. Through Hatha yoga, I emphasize proper alignment, steady practice, and awareness.My goal is to create a welcoming and supportive environment where students can explore yoga as a holistic practice for physical health, mental calmness, and personal growth.', 'Photo.jpg', 'Curriculum.pdf', '10-06-2026 13:21:31'),
(124, 'Dhruv Ahluwalia', '07021843799', 'dhruv.ahluwalia@yahoo.in', 'India ', 'Hatha', '6+ years', '200 hrs Yoga Teacher Training course ', 'I teach Hatha Yoga along with Mediation session. Also, guide them to plan diet for maximum gain.', 'image_e6b5312d~2.png', 'Dhruv_Ahluwalia.pdf', '11-06-2026 14:17:57'),
(125, 'Pragya Bhatt ', '7017073262', 'pragya19bhatt28@gmail.com', 'India ', 'Hatha yoga , meditation, pranayama, philosophy ', 'Conducted group classes and home class', 'RYT 200 hrs , Adiyoga Ashram, tapovan', 'Teaching Style\r\nMy classes integrate asana practice, pranayama, and mindfulness techniques to support physical strength, flexibility, and mental clarity. My teaching emphasizes correct posture, breath coordination, and mindful movement to create a balanced and effective practice environment.\r\n\r\nYoga Philosophy\r\nI believe yoga is not only a physical practice but a path toward inner balance, self-discipline, and emotional well-being. I encourage students to cultivate awareness, consistency, and mindfulness in both practice and daily life.', 'IMG-20260601-WA0005.jpg', 'resume.pdf', '20-06-2026 14:51:22'),
(126, 'Rama Meda', '8849134681', 'medarama@gmail.com', 'India ', 'Hatha , vinyasa and astanga', '20yrs', 'Msc yoga', 'Maintains levels and using props', 'IMG-20260604-WA0002.jpeg', 'Rama Meda CV 2 (1) (2).pdf.pdf', '20-06-2026 15:21:31'),
(127, 'JITENDRA KUMAR SHARMA', '06375730465', 'rajasthanhathyoga@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hath Yoga, Ashtanga Yoga, Pranayama, Meditation', '6 Years ', 'M.A in Yoga and Science of living ', 'My teaching style is student-centered, interactive, and focused on holistic development. I believe that yoga is not only about physical postures but also about developing mental well-being, discipline, self-awareness, and a healthy lifestyle.\r\n\r\nI create a positive and supportive learning environment where students feel motivated to participate and learn at their own pace. My approach combines yoga asanas, pranayama, meditation, and mindfulness practices to enhance physical fitness, concentration, emotional balance, and overall well-being.\r\n\r\nMy teaching philosophy is to inspire students to adopt yoga as a lifelong practice that promotes health, character building, and inner growth.\r\n', 'IMG_20260524_161802.jpg', 'Jitendra Kumar Sharma YOGA CV .pdf', '25-06-2026 06:43:57'),
(128, 'vardan', '07355817108', 'vardanbhardwaj885@GMAIL.COM', 'India', 'astanga yoga , ashtanga vinyasa , meditation , yoga sadhna', '3 year plus', 'bsc yogic sci , 500hr YTTC', 'Certified Yoga Instructor with 3+ years of experience guiding students in Hatha, Vinyasa, and Ashtanga yoga. Specializes in alignment-focused practice, breathwork, and mindful movement. Passionate about helping individuals build strength, flexibility, and mental clarity through structured and safe sessions.', 'IMG_1622.jpeg', 'Black and White Modern Professional CV Resume.pdf', '25-06-2026 22:40:52'),
(129, 'Aditya Pandey ', '8777312303', 'pandeyaditya3812@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha and astanga yoga', '2years and 6 years practitioner', 'Ttc', 'I teach traditional Hatha Yoga and Ashtanga Yoga, focusing on proper alignment, breath awareness, strength, flexibility, and mindfulness. My classes are suitable for beginners as well as intermediate practitioners, with an emphasis on safe practice, discipline, and holistic well-being. I create a supportive and motivating environment that helps students improve their physical health, mental focus, and inner balance through consistent yoga practice.', 'IMG_5222.jpeg', 'IMG_1793.pdf', '27-06-2026 21:36:08'),
(130, 'Anshika Bisht', '6397267725', 'bishtanshika110202@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hath', '2 year', 'Msc yoga therapy ( Central University of Rajasthan)', 'I give yoga module for overall health and wellness. \r\n', '20260512_122141.heic', 'resume .pdf', '29-06-2026 20:30:52'),
(131, 'Ashish Bagiyal', '9084595014', 'ashibagiyal03@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha asthanga', '3', 'Msc in yogic science hnbgu central university srinagar garhwal', 'I will teach hatha and asthanga flow and I also have a knowledge of yoga kriyas which is essential for cleansing of body. ', 'IMG-20260620-WA0026.jpg', 'RESUMEashu.pdf', '01-07-2026 12:41:37'),
(132, 'Ashish Bagiyal', '9084595014', 'ashibagiyal03@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha and asthanga', '3', 'Bsc and msc in yogascience from hnbgu central university srinagar ', 'My teaching styles is asthanga vinayasa and hatha flow. And I also like teaching yoga kriyas to students so that they adapt it in their lifestyle for internal cleansing of body. And want to expand my knowledge to every one who want to know.', 'IMG-20260620-WA0026.jpg', 'RESUMEashu.pdf', '01-07-2026 12:53:00'),
(133, 'Aastha', '7454869014', 'aasthakatariya24141@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hathayog, philosophy ', '6 months ', '200 yttc with M.a yoga ', ' I believe in creating a safe, supportive, and positive learning environment for every student. I focus on teaching with patience, clear instructions, and proper alignment to ensure each practice is safe and effective. I encourage students to progress at their own pace while building strength, flexibility, balance, and confidence. I also incorporate breathing techniques, mindfulness, and relaxation to promote both physical and mental well-being. My goal is to inspire students to enjoy their yoga journey and make yoga a meaningful part of their daily lives.', 'IMG_2563.jpeg', 'Aastha_Yoga_Instructor_CV.pdf', '05-07-2026 11:15:37'),
(134, 'Suneel singh kshatri ', '7354031306', 'rajasuneel2024@gmail.com', 'India', '02', '01', 'Master ', 'Yoga Trainer ', 'img20240724_13452165~2.jpg', 'resume (7).pdf', '09-07-2026 19:21:31'),
(135, 'Arvind Kumar', '8373020746', 'erarvindkumar99@gmail.com', 'India', 'Ashtanga', '2', 'MSc yoga', 'I have teacher ashtanga', 'Screenshot 2026-01-06 at 9.38.36 PM.png', 'Yog.pdf', '11-07-2026 13:14:33'),
(136, 'Utsav Khantwal', '7830362220', 'utsavkhantwal22@gmail.com', 'India', 'Hatha yoga', '3', 'University of patanjali and Shivanand vedant ashram', 'Holistic yogic lifestyle and living practices.\r\nSharing a deeper understanding of yoga to bring body mind and soul in synchronicity.\r\nLiving yogic wisdom to change the perception.', 'Screenshot_20260712-102528_Chrome.png', 'CV_20260707_091808_0000.pdf', '12-07-2026 10:28:03');
