onger interested in joining us, please let us know so we can adjust our email communications accordingly.\n\nLooking forward to your response!\n\nWarm Wishes,\nTeam Adhiroha\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Lost to Competition\n\nHope you are doing well.\n\nWe\'re interested to learn where you completed your program and about your experience. We look forward to staying in touch and welcoming you into the Adhiroha family in the future. Wishing you all the best and peace on your journey!\n\nYour feedback will help us retain students like you in the future.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Canceled/postponed\n\nIt\'s great to hear back from you.\n\nWe look forward to staying in touch and welcoming you back to the Adhiroha family whenever you\'re ready to continue your yoga journey. Wishing you all the best and peace on your path ahead!\n\nFeel free to connect for further assistance.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* Closing message\n\nAs our current session has ended, we want to express our sincere gratitude for your interest in our program. Unfortunately, entries are now closed. We value your enthusiasm and look forward to reconnecting in the future for upcoming opportunities. Visit www.adhiroha.com for details on joining our next available batch. \n\nWishing you all the best on your journey ahead!\n\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* 200 Hour with month query \n\nSubject: Yoga Teacher Training | 200 Hour | Rishikesh | India\n\nGlad to connect and delighted to know you want to pursue a yogic journey!\n\nOur \"Root of Yoga\" course | 200 Hour TTC | 24 Days | Scheduled from 1st of every month | Starting @1275 Euros  will be suited for you as the Best Rated Program in India to instil yoga in your daily life and pursue it as a Globally Certified P